<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Lughuru Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 SAMWELI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha mwanduso cha Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Samwe</para>
  <para style="mt1">SAMWELI</para>
  <para style="imt">ICHILONGOLE</para>
  <para style="ip">Ipfitabu pfa Samweli wa mwanduso na Samweli wa keli, mwanduso tsapfikala chitabu chikulu chimwe ichimanyike ka chitabu cha Samweli. Mwanduso ichitabu achino tsachigholighwa kuwa pfitabu pfili mna litoleo ilikemighwe Septuajinti. Alino tsalikala litoleo lya mwanduso lya tafasiri ya Laghano lya Ghumwande mna chilugha cha Chiyunani. Litaghwa lya itafasiri alyo tsalina mana ka itafasiri ayo tsayandikighwa na wanu sabini au sabini na weli wa Chiyahudi iwasomile. Mna itafasiri aino ya Chigiriki, ipfitabu pfa Samweli wa mwanduso na Samweli wa keli tsapfikemighwa Wafalume wa mwanduso na Wafalume wa keli. Mna litoleo lya Chilatini ipfitabu apfo tsapfikemighwa taghwa lingi. Litaghwa alyo tsa Wafalume wa mwanduso na Wafalume wa keli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Apfo ipfitabu ipfimanyika leloli ka Wafalume wa mwanduso na Wafalume wa keli tsapfikemighwa mna litoleo alyo Wafalume wa kadatu na Wafalume wa kane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ipfitabu pfa Samweli wa mwanduso na Samweli wa keli pfolangusa aghala ghayatendile nabii Samweli mna ughima wake, mfalume Sauli, na mfalume Daudi. Samweli yuyo iyatsighile kuwa mfalume ahala isi ya Isiraeli hailawile mna utawala wa Walamtsi na kwanza kutawalighwa na Wafalume.</para>
  <para style="ip">Samweli yuyo iyawabakile mapfuta Sauli na Daudi wawe wafalume wa Isiraeli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kuduhu iyomanya yuhi iyandike pfitabu pfa Samweli wa mwanduso na Samweli wa keli. Imunu iyandike ng'etambule baye mna ipfitabu apfino, lekeni tsa ka mghima mna matsuwa ghose ahala Daudi hayawile mfalume na tsa kamghima mna utawala awo na pfipfila tsakadaha ukwona na ukusoma tsibaluwa tsingi tsa Sauli na Samweli. Tsibaluwa tsingi itsandike ughima wa Sauli na Samweli. Kwa aghala ighapfisike mna awala iwandike ng'aimanyika ka ipfitabu apfino pfandikighwe tsuwachi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mghati mwe ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Isura ya 1-3 Tsolangusa ukwoneka na ukukomighwa kwa Samweli mna ukumsang'anila Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="io">Isura ya 4-7 Tsolangusa Wafilisti pfawalisolile Lisanduku lya laghanao lya Imulungu kulawa kwa Waisiraeli na apfila pfawatendile mbaka imiji ya Wafilisti yohinyighwa ahala lisanduku halikalile mna imiji yawo.</para>
  <para style="io">Isura ya 8-15 Tsolangusa Waisiraeli pfawabamile kuwa na mfalume; Pfipfila Samweli pfayambakile mapfuta Sauli yawe mfalume wa mwanduso na hambele Imulungu pfayamlemile Sauli.</para>
  <para style="io">Mna isura ya 16-31 Twosoma Samweli pfayambakile mapfuta Daudi yawe mfalume wa keli wa Isiraeli.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Elikana na wehe tsake ako Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Tsakuna munu yumwe iyakemighwe Elikana, iyalawile mna likabila lya Efraimu, iyakalile mna ghumji ghwa Rama mna isi ya pfidunda ya Efraimu. Yeye tsa imwana wa Yerohamu na mtsukulu wa Elihu, na chilembwe wa Tohu, wa lukolo lwa Sufu. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Elikana tsakana mapinga weli, yumwe tsakakemigwa Hana na wakeli tsakakemigwa Penina. Penina tsakana wana, lekeni Hana tsakahela wana. <verse eid="1SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Chila mwaka Elikana yang'ali yolawagha Rama na kugheluka kumtamanila na kumlapfila nambiko IMNDEWA iyana ingupfu ako Shilo. Ako iwana weli wa Eli, Hofini na Finehasi, wawo tsawawa watambika wa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Chila Elikana hayamlapfile imnyama yawe nambiko, yang'ali yomwing'agha Penina, ipinga wake hunde limwe. Pfipfila yang'ali yoweng'agha ghamahunde iwanaghe wamale na wapinga. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Lekeni Elikana yang'ali yomwing'agha Hana hunde kulu, kwaapfila tsakamkunda sideke, hata ka IMNDEWA tsakamtenda yaleke kweleka iwana.<verse eid="1SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Kuya Penina yang'ali yomghobola Hana, na kumdesa, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kamtenda yaleke kweleka wana. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Chinu achino chighendelela kulawila chila mwaka. Hana chila hayagheluke kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, Penina yang'ali yomghobola Hana, Hana yang'ali yolilagha na kwifeya ukuja. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Na Elikana, immale wake kamghutsa, “Hana chulila choni? Hebali ng'ukuja baye? Heule ukwona usungu? Angu nene sinoghile baye kubita iwana kumi?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hana na Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Nawo hawamalitse ukuja na ukunwa ako Shilo mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, Hana kenuka. Naye Eli mtambika mkulu tsakakala mna ichighoda habehi na ghumlango ghwa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Hana tsakona usungu ng'ani. Na hayang'ali yomlomba IMNDEWA, tsakalila kwa usungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Hana keka natsili, kalonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA yana ingupfu, undole nene mtumighwa wako! Ulole maghayo ghangu, na ung'umbuke, uleke kunisemwa! Ka kutsongaya mwana mmale, nelaha ghendo nitsokulapfila ghweghwe IMNDEWA imwana ayo yawe wako matsuwa ghake ghose hayatsokala mghima, na ng'atsogheta baye tsimvili tsake kwaapfila kalapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kupeta 6:4-7</char></note><verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Hana hayang'ali yoghendelela ukumlomba IMNDEWA, Eli yang'ali yolola ghumlomo ghwake. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana yang'ali yolomba chinyelenyele aku mlomo ghwake ghung'ali ghohighisika, lekeni chayolonga ng'achihulikika baye. Eli tsakaghitsa Hana kapatika. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Apfo Eli kamlongela Hana, “Apfi kutsoghendelela ukupatika mbaka tsuwachi? Leka kunwa imbwali.”<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Hana kamwidika, “Baye mkulu wangu, nene na ipinga yane usungu ng'ani, nene sinwele baye dipfai wala mbwali, lekeni ning'ali nimlapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu ighali mna ghumoyo ghwangu. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Uleke kumbona ka nene na ipinga inikoneka si chinu baye. Ning'ali nolomba apfino kwaapfila nina usungu na noghanzika.”<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Eli kamwidika, “Ughende tseghamba na Imulungu yakwing'e aghala ghaumlombile.”<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Hana kalonga, “Nokulomba unilolese pfinoghile.” Kuya Hana koka, kaja ichijo na ichihanga chake nachoneke na usungu keli baye.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwelekighwa kwa Samweli na ukulapfighwa kwa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Ilupfi haipfikile, Elikana na iwanu wa ikaye yake walamka mitondotondo, wamlomba IMNDEWA, kuya woya ukaye yawo ako Rama. Elikana kawasa na Hana mwehe wake, na IMNDEWA kamwidika Hana achila chayalombile. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Apfo Hana kakinda inda, keleka mwana mmale, naye kamkema Samweli, kwaapfila tsakalonga, “Nimlomba kwa Imulungu.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Elikana na iwanu wose wa ikaye yake wagheluka keli Shilo kumlapfila IMNDEWA nambiko ya chila mwaka na kutimilitsa natsili. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Lekeni Hana ng'agheluke baye, kwaapfila Hana tsakamlongela mmale wake apfino, “Mbaka imwana hayatsoleka kughwawa, nitsomghala kuko na nitsolamlapfa kwa IMNDEWA yakale kuko matsuwa ghake ghose gha ugima wake wose.”<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Elikana, mmale wake kamwidika, “Tenda ighokunoghetsa, ukale ahano mbaka imwana hayatsoleka kughwawa. Na IMNDEWA yatimilitse inatsili yawikile.” Apfo Hana kakala ukaye, kamlela imwanaghe mbaka imwana hayalekile ukughwawa.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Imwana hayalekile ukughwawa, Hana kamsola, hamwe na ing'ombe mmale wa miyaka midatu, lobota limwe lya usaghe na supa ya ngotsi ine dipfai kamghala kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA ako Shilo, na imwana ayo tsayang'ali mdodo. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Nawo hawamchinjile ing'ombe ayula, wamghala imwana kwa mtambika Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Hana kamlongela, “Ghwe mkulu wangu, ka apfila Imulungu pfayakwikile mgima, apfi kwonikumbuka? Nene yuyo ipinga ayula iyemile habehi naghwe, iyang'ali yomlomba IMNDEWA Imulungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Ning'ali nimlomba IMNDEWA Imulungu yangaye imwana ayuno, naye IMNDEWA Imulungu kangaya ka pfanimlombile. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Apfo nomwing'a IMNDEWA Imulungu imwana ayuno, ghamatsuwa ghose hayatsokala mghima, yeye kalapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA Imulugu.” Kuya ako wamtamanila IMNDEWA Imulungu.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Hana komtunya MNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Kuya Hana kalomba, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">“Nomdeng'elela IMNDEWA mna ghumoyo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">nomtunya IMNDEWA iyali ngupfu tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">nowaseka awala iwonyihila nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">kwaapfila nodeng'elela pfaunikombole.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />Kuduhu iyali mwenzeluka ka IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">kuduhu wowose ka yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">kuduhu bambalawe ka Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Mleke kwitunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">mleke kulonga mbuli tsa ukwighoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">kwaapfila IMNDEWA ka Imulungu iyomanya ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">na kohigha aghala ghawotenda iwanu.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Minde tse iwanu iwali na ngupfu tsibeneka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:4">Lekeni iwanu iwaghendile wotsenzeuka sambi wana ngupfu.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Iwanu awala iwakalile na ipfijo bwelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">sambi wohemela ipfijo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Lekeni iwakalile na inzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">sambi wahela nzala keli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Ipinga iyakalile mghumba, sambi keleka wana saba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Lekeni iyali na iwana wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">sambi kahela mwana. <verse eid="1SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />IMNDEWA kokoma na koghala ughima:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">kowahulumsa iwanu kutsimu na kowenula.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Imulungu kowatenda iwanu wangi wawe wahingwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">na wangi wawe wana mali nyingi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">Iwanu wangi kowahulumsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">na wangi kowenula.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Kowenula iwahingwa kulawa mna litimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">kowenula iwolomba kulawa mna lipfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">koweka hamwe na iwakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">na kowatenda wakalile ipfighoda pfawokala iwakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">kwaapfila tsingutso tsa isi tsa kwake yeye IMNDEWA. Naye kaimitsa isi mchanya mwa tsingutso atso.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Katsowakinga wahenzeluka wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">lekeni iwanu iwehile watsokala mna ichisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">Haduhu munu iyatsohuma kwa ngupfu tsake.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Awala iwomwihila IMNDEWA watsobenighwabenighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">kulawa kulanga katsowadumila ka ladu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">IMNDEWA, katsoihigha isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">na katsomwing'a ngupfu mfalume wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">pfipfila katsakongetsa tsingupfu tsa imunu wake iyamsaghule.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Kuya Elikana koya ukaye yake Rama, lekeni imsongolo Samweli kakala Shilo komtumikila IMNDEWA aku kolongotsighwa na mtambika Eli.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wa Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Lelo iwana wa Eli tsaweha ghendo, ng'awamwalangitse ghendo IMNDEWA baye, <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />wala ing'onde yawo ya ukutambika. Iwanu hawang'ali wopilusa inyama kulawa kuna wanyama iwawasubutule wawe nambiko, imwana yumwe wa Eli yang'ali yomtumagha imtumighwa wake iyakindile lubiki lwa kuhomela nyama lwa manda ndatu, <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />naye yang'ali yohoma kwa ngupfu mna ichiha ichipiluka inyama, inyama yoyose ihomighwa na ukulapfighwa na ilubiki alwo yakuwa ya imtambika. Apfi pfipfo pfawawatendele Waisiraeli wose iwang'ali woghenda Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Pfipfila, ng'ana mapfuta ghalakatsighwe baye kuna imatsabahu, imtumighwa wa mtambika kakutsa komlongela imunu iyomsubutula imnyama wa inambiko, “Mlapfile mtambika inyama ya ukwoka, kwaapfila yeye ng'obokela baye inyama yako yautsopilusa, ila kobokela inyama imbisi.”<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Imunu ayo yang'amwidika apfino, “Leka tanu nilakatse ghamapfuta, kuya kutsosola chochose chaubama.” Imtumighwa ayo komwidika, “Baye, ngaya sambi, ka ng'ungaya, nitsokuboka.”<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Inzambi aino ya iwasongolo awo wa Eli tsa ng'ulu ng'ani hambele ha IMNDEWA, kwaapfila iwasongolo awo tsawapfibetsa ipfinu ipfilapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA Imulungu.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli ako Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Ghamatsuwa agho, Samweli kaghendelela kumtumikila IMNDEWA, yang'ali yopfalagha chitsibao chitselu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">chiguo ichipfalighwa mmambagha na imtambika hayomtumikila Imulungu</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Chila mwaka mai wake tsakamdadatsila Samweli kanzu ndodo, na kamghalila hawang'ali wogheluka kulapfa nambiko yeye na mmale wake. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Eli kambaliki Elikana na pinga wake, kalonga, “Kubitila ipinga ayuno, IMNDEWA yakwing'e iwana wangi ili wasole hanu ha imwana ayuno iyamlapfile ipinga wako yawe wa IMNDEWA.” Kuya Elikana na Hana woya ukaye. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />IMNDEWA kamtendela uluso Hana, naye keleka iwana watano, wadatu wamale na weli wapinga. Msongolo Samweli kakula na kaghendelela kumtumikila IMNDEWA Imulungu.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli na iwanaghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Eli tsakalala ng'ani. Na kahulika ghose iwanaghe ghawawatendele Waisiraeli na pfawawasile na wapinga iwang'ali wosang'ana mna ghumlango ghwa Lihema lienzeluke. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Kawaghutsa, “Heule mwotenda apfino? Nohulika kulawa kwa iwanu ka mwemwe mwotenda ghehile. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Mleke ukutenda apfo wanangu, kwaapfila aghala ghanihulika kulawa kwa iwanu wa IMNDEWA, gheha. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Imunu yang'amtendela miyaghe nzambi, munu yungi kodaha komlombela kwa Imulungu. Lekeni imunu yang'amtendela inzambi Imulungu, yuhi iyodaha kumlombela?” Lekeni iwana awo ng'awamuhulikitse baye aba wawo, kwaapfila IMNDEWA mwenyegho tsakabama ukuwakoma.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Imsongolo Samweli kaghendelela kukula, IMNDEWA na iwanu wamkunda ng'ani.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfawatsoghaya iwanu wa ikaye ya Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Tsuwa limwe, munu wa Imulungu kamghendela Eli, kamlongela, “IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Apfi nene silanguse nimwenyegho baye kwa ikaye ya Aruni na iwakulu wako hawang'ali watumwa wa Farao mna isi ya Misiri? <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Tsanimsaghula Aruni na ikaye yake kulawa mna ghamakabila ghose gha Isiraeli kuwa watambika wangu, wanitumikile mna imatsabau, wadusule upfumba na kupfala chitsibao hambele hangu. Tsaniweng'a iwanu wa ikaye ya aba wako nambiko tsangu tsawanilapfile Waisiraeli kwa moto. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Heule lelo mwotsonela basu tsinambiko tsa iwanyama na ipfinu pfaniwalaghitse iwanu wangu wangalile? Naghwe heule kuwategheletsa iwanagho kubita nene, na sambi mnaneha kwa ukuja tsinambiko tsinoghile itsilapfighwe na iwanu wangu wa Isiraeli?’ <verse eid="1SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />Apfo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli kolonga apfino, ‘Ona tsanonga ikaye yako na lukolo lwako mtsakutsa hambele hangu kunitumikila ghamatsuwa ghose.’ Lekeni sambi nene Imulungu nolonga apfino, ‘Sitsotenda keli apfo baye.’ Nowatunya awala iwonitunya, na awala iwonibetsa na nene nowabetsa. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Tegheletsa, ghamatsuwa ighakutsa nitsowakoma iwasongolo wose mna ikaye yako na mna ilukolo lwako, apfo mna ikaye yako ng'akutsakuwa na mmale wowose iyatsokala mbaka yalale. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Kutsoghaya na kutsowonela gele wayagho kwa aghala ighanoghile ghanitsoweng'a iwanu wangi wa Isiraeli, na kwa ghamatsuwa ghose, kutsakuwa kuduhu munu mna ikaye yako iyatsokala mbaka yalale. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Ka nitsomleka imtsukulu wako yumwe yawe mgima, na yasang'ane hana imatsabahu yangu, nene nitsombofula tsinenge, kuya katsakona usungu na katsoghanzika, na iwatsukulu wako wose watsakufa pfihile. <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />Achila ichitsowalawila iwanagho weli, Hofini na Finehasi, chitsakuwa chitango kuna ghweghwe. Wose weli watsakufa tsuwa limwe. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Kuya nitsomwinula mtambika yungi yanimtoghola, yawe wangu, yeye katsotenda ka apfila pfanibama nene. Nitsomtenda yawe na watsukulu wengi, nawo kwa matsuwa ghose watsomsang'anila imfalume yanimsaghula. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Pfipfila, munu wowose iyatsokala mghima mna ikaye yako katsomghendela imtambika ayo na kumlomba sendi na chijo, na kumlongela, ‘Chonde chonde nokulomba nyike mna isang'ano ya ukutambika ili mbate chijo ndiye.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu komkema Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho imsongolo Samweli yang'ali yomtomikila IMNDEWA aku kolongotsighwa na Eli. Usenga na ghamaono kulawa kwa IMNDEWA pfing'ali pfilawila mala lumwelumwe. <verse eid="1SA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Eli tsakalala mbaka tsinenge tsake tsanza ukuleka kwona pfinoghile. Chilo chimwe tsakawasa mna ichiheleto chake, <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />naye Samweli tsakawasa mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA habehi na Lisanduku la laghano lya Imulungu. Na ichitasa cha Imulungu tsaching'ali chikwaka kwaapfila tsakung'ali ng'ana kuche baye. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Apfo IMNDEWA kakema, “Samweli!” Naye Samweli kedika, “Oo, na ahano!” <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Kuya Samweli katsuma kamghendela Eli, kamlongela, “Nitsa, ghweghwe kung'ema.” Lekeni Eli kamwidika, “Nene sikukemile baye, ghenda ukawase.” Samweli koka kaghenda kuwasa.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />IMNDEWA kamkema keli Samweli, “Samweli!” Baho Samweli kalamka, kamghendela Eli, kamlongela, “Nitsa, ghweghwe kung'ema.” Lekeni Eli kamlongela, “Mwanangu sikukemile baye, ghenda ukawase keli.” <verse eid="1SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Samweli tsang'ana yamtange baye IMNDEWA, na usenga wa IMNDEWA ng'ana umlawile baye.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />IMNDEWA kamkema Samweli lwa kadatu, Samweli kalamka, kamghendela Eli, kamlongela, “Nitsa ghweghwe kung'ema.” Baho Eli katanga ka iyamkemile Samweli tsa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Apfo Eli kamlongela Samweli, “Ghenda ukawase na yang'akukema, ulonge apfino, ‘Longa ghwe IMNDEWA, nene mtumighwa wako nokutegheletsa!’ ” Kuya Samweli kaghenda kuwasa hanu hake.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Hambele IMNDEWA katsa kamwimila habei na kamkema Samweli ka pfayamkemagha, “Samweli! Samweli!” Samweli kalonga, “Longa, nene mtumighwa wako nokutegheletsa.”<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Baho IMNDEWA kamlongela Samweli, “Lola, nene nobama nende chinu mna isi ya Isiraeli, na chila munu hayatsohulika katsakwiduka. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Mna litsuwa alyo nitsomtendela Eli na ikaye yake aghala ghose ghanongole ukulonga. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Nimlongela ka nitsoidununza kaye yake ghamatsuwa ghose, kwa ighehile ghayamanyile kwaapfila iwanaghe wandigha nene, naye ng'awaghomile baye. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Apfo nilaha ghendo, ka inzambi ya Eli na iwanaghe ng'aileghusighwa baye kwa nambiko ya mnyama au ya pfinu.”<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samweli kawasa ahala mbaka nemitondo, kuya kalamka, kapfughula imilango ya ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Lekeni kapfuka ukumlongela Eli achila chayahulike kulawa kwa Imulungu. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Eli kamkema Samweli, “Mwanangu Samweli.” Samweli kamwidika, “Oo, mkulu wangu!”<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Eli kamghutsa, “Angu IMNDEWA yakulongele choni? Uleke kunipfisa chayakulongele. Ka kutsonipfisa, Imulungu katsokudununza ng'ani.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Apfo Samweli kamlongela ghose, ng'ampfisile chinu chochose baye. Naye Eli kalonga, “Yeye yuyo IMNDEWA, yatende chochose chayakona chinogha.”<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Samweli kakula na IMNDEWA tsakahamwe naye, na aghala ghose ghayalongile kuduhu hata limwe ing'alitimile. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Iwanu wose mna isi ya Isiraeli kulawa ghumji ghwa Dani ubali wa Kasikazini mbaka Beeri Sheba ubali wa kusini watanga ka Samweli tsa nabii ghendo wa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />IMNDEWA kaghendelela ukwilangusa ako Shilo, kwayamlawile Samweli na ukulonga naye. Naye Samweli hayalongile chinu Waisiraeli wose wang'ali womtegheletsa.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Wafilisti woboka Lisanduku lya laghano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Samweli kawalongela Waisiraeli usenga aula wayeng'ighwe na Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">Ghamatsuwa agho, Wafilisti wetingana hamwe wetowe na Waisiraeli. Waisiraeli weka indalo yawo ako Ebenezeri na Wafilisti weka indalo ako Afeki. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Wafilisti wakala ghoya wawatowe Waisiraeli, nawo wawatowa ghendo Waisiraeli. Na baho Waisiraeli elfu nne wakomighwa mna ing'ondo ayo. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Waisiraeli iwahonile hawoyile kuna indalo, iwabala wa Isiraeli weghutsa, “Heule leloli IMNDEWA kawaleka Wafilisti watutowe? Tukeni tukalisole Lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA kulawa Shilo, ili yeye IMNDEWA yatse yatwapfile na yatukombole kulawa kuna iwanu iwotwihila.” <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Apfo wawatuma wanu waghende Shilo, nawo walighala Lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA yana ingupfu iyokala mchanya mwa wapfiumbe weli wane mabawa iwakemighwe makerubi. Awala iwana wamale weli wa Eli, Hofini na Finehasi tsawatsa na lisanduku alila lya IMNDEWA.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Na Lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA halipfikile mna indalo, Waisiraeli wose wadeng'elela kwa kukememela, mbaka isi ihighisika. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Wafilisti hawahulike Waeburaniya pfawodeng'elela waghutsa, “Ukudeng'elela ako kuna indalo ya Waeburaniya kuna mana yachi?” Hawamanyile ka Lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA lipfika kuna indalo ya Waisiraeli, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Wafilisti wapfuka walonga, “Milungu ipfika mkaye mwawo!” Walonga keli, “Tutsochona! Chinu ka achino ng'ana chitulawile baye! <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Tutsochona ghendo! Yuhi iyodaha kutukombola kulawa kwa imilungu ayo ina ingupfu? Ayo iyo imilungu iwatowile Wamisiri kwa chila janga ako kunyika. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Lelo mwemwe Wafilisiti mghangamale na mleke kutenyuka, muwe walume, mwitowe, ili mleke kuwa watumwa wa Waeburaniya ka wawo pfawali watumwa wetu. Muwe walume, mwitowe.”<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Wafilisti wetowa nawo, nawo Waisiraeli watowighwa, na chila munu katsumila kuna lihema lyake. Mna litsuwa alyo wanu wengi wakomighwa, wakomighwa masikali elufu selasini wa Isiraeli iwoghenda kwa maghulu. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA libokighwa, na awala iwana weli wa Eli, Hofini na Finehasi nawo wakomighwa.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Litsuwa lilyo, munu yumwe kulawa mna kabila lya Benjamini tsakatsuma kulawa kwing'ondo, na kapfika Shilo mna litsuwa lilyo, aku ghamaghwanda ghake kadegha na kemwaghila timbwisi mwitwi mwake, kalangutsa apfila pfayali na usungu. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Eli tsakakala mna ichighoda chake mmbalimbali mwa inzila kololesa, kwapfila yang'ali yakwalangula lisanduku lya Imulungu mmoyo mwake. Imunu ayula hayapfikile mna ghumji na kuwalongela iwanu achila ichilawile, iwanu wose wangula chililo. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli hayahulike iwanu wolila, kaghutsa, “Iwanu awo wolilila choni?” Imunu ayula katsuma kaghenda kwa Eli, kamlongela imbuli ayo. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Matsuwa agho Eli tsakana miyaka tisini na nane na tsinenge ng'atsing'ali tsikona ghoya baye. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Imunu ayula kamlongela Eli, “Sambi nene ndawa kung'ondo, na nitsuma kulawa kung'ondo leloli aino.” Eli kamghutsa, “Mwanangu, choni ichilawile?” <verse eid="1SA 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Imunu ayula iyaghalile usenga, kalonga, “Waisiraeli wawatsuma Wafilisti. Waisiraeli wengi wakomighwa, hata iwanagho weli Hofini na Finehasi wose wakomighwa, na Lisanduku lya laghano lya Imulungu libokighwa.”<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Imunu ayo hayalongile ka sanduku lya Imulungu libokighwa, Eli kaghwa chalughata kulawa hana ichighoda chake mmbalimbali mwa lilango. Eli hayaghwile apfo, singo yake ibeneka kwaapfila tsakaneneha, baho kafa. Eli tsakawa mlamutsi wa Waisiraeli kwa miyaka alubaini.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa chitsuka wa Finehasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Mkwe wake Eli, pinga wa Finehasi, tsakana inda, na kahabehi ukweleka. Hayahulike ka lisanduku lya laghano lya Imulungu libokighwa na mkwe wake na mmale wake wose wafa, baho usungu umluma na keleka mwana. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Apfo ipinga ayula hayang'ali yakufa, awala iwang'unga iwang'ali womwapfila wamlongela, “Uleke kupfuka, kweleka mwana mmale.” Lekeni yeye ng'edike wala ng'awategheletse baye. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Naye kamkema imwanaghe Ikabodi, mana yake, “Utunitso wa Imulungu uka mna isi ya Isiraeli.” Tsakamkema apfo kwaapfila Lisanduku lya laghano libokighwa, na aba mkwe wake na immale wake wose wafa. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Kalonga, “Utunitso wa Imulungu uka mna isi ya Isiraeli kwaapfila lisanduku lya Imulungu libokighwa.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Wafilisti na Lisanduku lya laghano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Wafilisti hawalibokile lisanduku lya Imulungu, waghenda nalyo kulawa kuna ghumji ghwa Ebenezeri mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Ashidodi. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Kuya waliduta lisanduku lya IMNDEWA, waghenda nalyo kuna ing'anda ya mulungu wawo Dagoni na walika habehi na chinyagho cha Dagoni. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Iwanu wa Ashidodi hawalamke nemitondo, wachona chinyagho cha Dagoni chifudabala hambele ya Lisanduku lya IMNDEWA. Wachisola ichinyagho cha Dagoni na wachimitsa keli hanu hake. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Lekeni hawalamke nemitondotondo, tsawona chinyagho cha Dagoni chifudabala hambele ha lisanduku lya IMNDEWA. Litwi, ghamaghulu, na ghamoko gha ichinyagho acho pfose pfibeneka, tsapfiwasa mna ichitsingiti. Ilukalile tsa ilukuli luliyeka lwa ichinyagho cha Dagoni. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Apfo watambika wa Dagoni na iwanu wose iwakwingila kumtambikila Dagoni ako Ashidodi, ng'awokanyagha baye ichitsingiti acho mbaka leloli.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />IMNDEWA kawadununza ng'ani na kawatenda iwanu wa Ashidodi wampfuke. Tsakawadununza hata iwanu iwali habehi nawo, kwa kuwaghalila mapute. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Iwanu wa Ashidodi hawonile aghala ighawapatile welongela, “Imulungu wa Isiraeli kotudununza ng'ani twetwe hamwe na mulungu wetu Dagoni. Lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA ng'alidaha baye ukukala kuna twetwe.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Apfo wawatuma wanu waghende wakawalongele wakulu wose wa Wafilisti, nawo wetingana hamwe, wawaghutsa, Angu tulitendatse lisanduku alino lya Imulungu wa Isiraeli? Iwakulu awo wedika, “Sanduku alyo lya Imulungu wa Isiraeli lighaleni Gati.” Apfo walighala ako kuna ghumji ghwa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Lekeni hawalighalile ako Gati IMNDEWA kaghutowa ghumji agho, kawatenda iwanu wapfuke ng'ani, kawatowa iwamale wa isi ayo, iwasongolo na iwakulu kwa kuwaghalila ghamapute. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Apfo walighala lisanduku alyo lya Imulungu ako kuna ghumji ghwa Ekironi. Lekeni Lisanduku alyo lya Imulungu halipfikile ako, iwanu wa isi ayo wakemelela, walonga, “Watughalila lisanduku lya Imulungu wa Isiraeli ili litukome twetwe na iwanu wetu.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Kuya wawatuma wanu na wawatinganitsa watawala wa Wafilisti na kuwalongela, “Lyuitseni lisanduku lya Imulungu wa Isiraeli hanu hake, hela litsotukoma twetwe na iwanu wetu.” Tsawatenda apfo kwaapfila iwanu tsawapfuka ng'ani mna isi yose, na Imulungu yang'ali yowadununza ng'ani. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Na awala ing'awafile Imulungu tsakawadununza na ghamapute na chililo chawo chipfika kulanga.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Sanduku lya laghano lyakuya Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Sanduku lya IMNDEWA likala mna isi ya Wafilisti kwa miyetsi saba. <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Wafilisti wawakema watambika wawo na iwatowa lamli wawo, wawaghutsa, “Tulitendetse Lisanduku alino lya IMNDEWA? Tulongeleni, tutsodahatse kulyuyitsa hanu hake?”<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Nawo wawedika, “Mng'alyuyitsa lisanduku lya Imulungu, mleke kulyuyitsa hela. Lekeni hamlyuyitsa ghaleni na nambiko ya ukuleghusa matotso, namwe matotso ghenu ghatsoleghusighwa. Mng'atenda apfo mtsohona, namwe mtsomanya heule yang'ali yowadununza.”<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Iwanu waghutsa, “Tutsomghalila nambiko yachi ya ukuleghusa matotso?” Wawo wedika, “Mumghalile pfinyagho pfitano pfa nzahabu ipfili ka mapute, na pfinyagho pfitano ipfili ka mbewa, chila chinyagho chime hanu ha mkulu yumwe wa Wafilisti, kwaapfila utamu wayamghalileni mwemwe, wuwo wayawaghalile iwakulu wenu. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Apfo mfine pfinyagho ipfikoneka ka mapute, na pfinyagho ipfikoneka ka wambewa iwohinya isi yenu, namwe mumtunye Imulungu wa Isiraeli, songaha katsoleka ukuwadununza mwemwe, na milungu yenu, na isi yenu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Heule mwoitenda imimoyo yenu iwe misughu ka awala Wamisiri, na ka ayula Farao? Imulungu hayawadununze Wamisiri, angu ng'awawalekile baye Waisiraeli woke, nawo tsawoka? <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Apfo mtende mtuka ghwa sambi ghwa ukukweghighwa na ng'ombe, na ng'ombe weli iwakong'etsa, ng'ana wohighwe nira baye, muwohe mna ghumtuka aghwo, lekeni iwana wawo muwoyitse mkaweke kuna ichibanda chawo. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Soleni Lisanduku lya Imulungu na mlike mna ghumtuka aghwo. Mmbalimbali mwa lisanduku alyo mwike ipfinyagho apfila pfa nzahabu pfamumghalila ka nambiko ya ukuleghusa matotso ghenu. Kuya mlileke lighende lyenyegho. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Apfo mlilolese, ling'alumbilila mbaka kuna isi yake, kughenda Beti Shemeshi, aho tutsomanya ka iyatughalile utamu auno Imulungu wa Isiraeli. Lekeni ka ng'alilumbilila baye ako, aho tutsomanya ka si yeye Imulungu baye iyatudununze, utamu awo ulawila wenyegho.”<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Iwanu awala tsawatenda ka pfawalongelighwe, wawasola ng'ombe weli iwoghwawisa na wawoha mna ghumtuka aghwo, iwana wawo wawoha mna ichibanda chawo. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Lisanduku alila lya IMNDEWA walika mna ghumtuka aghula hamwe na lisanduku lina ipfinyagho pfa nzahabu na wambewa na apfila pfa ghamapute. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Ng'ombe awo walumbilila mbaka mna ghumji ghwa Beti Shemeshi, nawo ng'awabaghuke baye kumoso wala kujilo, na wang'ali woghenda aku wolila. Na wafalume watano wa Wafilisti wawawinza mbaka kuna ghumbaka ghwa Beti Shemeshi.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Iwanu wa Beti Shemeshi wang'ali wopfuna ingano kulwanda. Hawalolile kuchanya na kulyona lisanduku, wadeng'elela ng'ani. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Ghumtuka aghula ghupfika mna ghumghunda ghwa Yoshua, imunu wa isi ya Beti Shemeshi. Haghupfikile aho ghwima habehi na libambalawe. Iwanu waitula imibiki ya ghumtuka aghula na wawasubutula wang'ombe awala na wamlapfila IMNDEWA, nayo iwa nambiko ya ukulukatsighwa. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Nawo Walawi walihulumsa lisanduku lya Imulungu hamwe na lisanduku alila lina ipfinyagho pfa nzahabu, na weka mna libambalawe. Kuya iwanu wa isi ya Beti Shemeshi walapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsigwa, na wamsubutulila IMNDEWA mna litsuwa lilyo. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Iwakulu awala watano wa Wafilisti hawonile aghala, woya Ekironi mna litsuwa lilyo.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Apfino pfipfo ipfinyagho pfa nzahabu Wafilisti pfawamghalile IMNDEWA ka nambiko ya ukuleghusa matotso, chila chinyagho chimwe kwa mji ghumwe, chimwe kwa mji ghwa Ashidodi, chimwe kwa mji ghwa Gaza, chimwe kwa mji ghwa Ashikeloni, chimwe kwa mji ghwa Gati, na chimwe kwa mji ghwa Ekironi. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Pfipfila wamghalila ipfinyagho pfitano pfa nzahabu pfa wambewa kwa imiji yose itawalighwe na wakulu watano wa Wafilisti. Imiji ayo tsaitsungulusighwa ubanda, na pfijiji pfawo tsapfahela ubanda. Libambalawe alila lili mna ghumghunda ghwa Yoshua wa Beti Shemeshi lyabaho mbaka leloli ka chitango kwa achila ichilawile.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />IMNDEWA kawakoma wanu sabini wa Beti Shemeshi, kwaapfila tsawasungulila mghati mwa lisanduku lya lmulungu, iwanu walila kwaapfila IMNDEWA kawakoma wanu wengi ng'ani.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lisanduku lya laghano ako Kiriati Yearimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Kuya iwanu wa isi ya Beti Shemeshi walonga, “Yuhi iyodaha kwima hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu ayuno mwenzeluka? Tutsolighala kuna nani ili lilawe kuna twetwe?” <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Apfo wawatuma wanu waghende kwa iwanu wa Kiriati Yearimu, walonge, “Wafilisti walyuyitsa Lisanduku lya IMNDEWA, mhulumke mtse mlisole.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Apfo iwanu wa Kiriati Yearimu waghenda kulisola lisanduku lya IMNDEWA, walighala ukaye kwa Abinadabu, iyakalile mchidunda. Wamhimika imwanaghe mmale iyakemighwe Eleazari yalilolese lisanduku alyo lya IMNDEWA.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli kakuwa mlamtsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Sanduku lya IMNDEWA likala mna isi ya Kiriati Yearimu kwa miyaka mingi, ka miyaka ishilini. Mna ghamatsuwa ghose agho Waisiraeli wose wamlilila IMNDEWA yawapfile.<verse eid="1SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Samweli kawalongela Waisiraeli, “Ka mwomuyila IMNDEWA kwa imimoyo yenu yose, mwobamighwa muilapfe imilungu ya chigheni na ipfinyagho pfa Ashitaroti. Mwilapfe kwa IMNDEWA kwa ghumoyo ghose na kumtumikila yeye yaliyeka, naye katsowakombola kulawa mna ghamoko gha Wafilisti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Apfo Waisiraeli wapfasa kutali ipfinyagho pfa Mabaali na Maashitaroti, nawo wamtumikila IMNDEWA yaliyeka.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Kuya Samweli kalonga, “Muwakeme Waisiraeli wose wetingane ako Mispa, na kuko nitsowalombela kwa IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Apfo Waisiraeli wose wetingana ako Mispa. Wadegha matsi na kughaghida hambele ha IMNDEWA, litsuwa alila lyose wafunga ukuja walonga, “Tutenda nzambi hambele ha IMNDEWA.” Samweli tsa mlamtsi wa wanu wa Isiraeli ako Mispa.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Wafilisti hawahulike ka Waisiraeli wetingana ako Mispa, wakulu wa tano wa Wafilisti waghenda kuwatowa. Waisiraeli hawahulike imbuli aino wawapfuka Wafilisti. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Waisiraeli wamlongela Samweli, “Ghendelela ukutulombela kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu yadahe kutukombola kulawa kwa Wafilisti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Apfo Samweli kamsola ng'olo mdodo kamlapfila IMNDEWA ka nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa. Kuya kamlomba IMNDEWA yawapfile Waisiraeli, na IMNDEWA kamwidika ukulomba kwake.<verse eid="1SA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Samweli hayang'ali yolapfa inambiko, Wafilisti wasoghela habehi kuwatowa Waisiraeli. Lekeni litsuwa alyo IMNDEWA kawadumila Wafilisti kwa mdumo mkulu, nawo Wafilisti waweghela na wawingighwa na Waisiraeli. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Waisiraeli walawa Mispa wawawinza Wafilisti mbaka habehi na ghumji ghwa Beti Kari, kuko wawakoma.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Kuya Samweli kasola libwe na kulihimika haghatighati ha Mispa na Sheni, kalikema libwe alyo Ebenezeri, kalonga, “IMNDEWA katwapfila mbaka sambi.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Apfo Wafilisti watowighwa, nawo ng'awengile keli baye mna isi ya Isiraeli. Na IMNDEWA yang'ali yowadununza wafilisiti mna ghamatsuwa ghose Samweli ghayakalile mgima. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Imiji yose ya Waisiraeli isolighwe na Wafilisti kulawa Ekironi mbaka Gati yuya kwa Waisiraeli, nawo waikombola isi yawo kulawa kwa Wafilisti. Kuya Waisiraeli na Waamori wakala bila ukwisonga.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samweli kaghendelela kuwa mlamtsi wa Isiraeli matsuwa ghake ghose ghayakalile mgima. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Chila mwaka Samweli kayangila imiji ya Beteli, Giligali na Mispa na kuwalamlitsa Waisiraeli iwang'ali wokala mna imiji ayo. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Kuya yang'ali yakuyagha Rama, kwaapfila ako tsa ukaye yake, tsakawalamlitsa Waisiraeli, na kuko kamtsengela IMNDEWA matsabahu.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli wolomba wawe na mfalume</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 17:14-20">Kumb 17:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Samweli hayalalile, kawatenda iwanaghe wamale wawe walamtsi wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Imwanaghe chaudele kakemighwa Yoweli, na wa keli kakemighwa Abiya. Wose weli wawa walamtsi wa Beeri Sheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Lekeni iwana awo ng'awatendile baye ka aba wawo pfayatendile, chawabamile wawo wapate litobole. Wabokela hongo chinyelenyele na waghahigha pfihile ghamaghomba.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Kuya wakulu wose wa Isiraeli wetingana hamwe, wamghendela Samweli ako Rama. <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />Wamlongela, “Lola, ghweghwe sambi kulala na iwanagho ng'awotenda baye ka ghweghwe. Apfo tusaghulile mfalume wa kutulongotsa ka apfila pfatsili isi tsingi.” <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Lekeni mbuli ya Waisiraeli ya ukubama weng'ighwe mfalume wa ukuwalongotsa, Samweli ng'ayonile baye ka inogha. Naye kamlomba IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Na IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Tegheletsa chila chinu iwanu chawokulongela, kwaapfila ng'awakulemile ghweghwe baye, ila wandema nene nileke kuwa mfalume wawo. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Ka pfawanitendele nene kulawa haniwalapfile Misiri, mbaka leloli, wandeka na wotambikila milungu ingi. Na wokutendela ghweghwe aghala ghawanendele nene. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Lekeni wategheletse, na uwakanye ghendo, na walongele mwatsimwatsi imfalume yatsowalongotsa ghayatsowabama wamtendele.”<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Naye Samweli kawalongela iwanu awala iwabamile weng'ighwe mfalume, aghala ghose IMNDEWA ghayamlongele. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Kawalongela, “Apfi pfipfo mfalume wenu iyatsowalongotsa pfayatsowatendela. Katsowasola iwanenu wamale na kuwatenda wawe wakwendesa mituka yake ikweghighwa na wafalasi, na wangi wawe wakwila falasi wake, na wangi watsomkinga kwa ukutsuma hambele ha ghumituka ghwake ighukweghighwa na wafalasi. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Katsowasaghula iwanu wangi wawe wakulu iwolongotsa iwanu wake elufu imwe wa ing'ondo, na wangi wawe wakulu iwolongotsa wanu hamsini wa ing'ondo. Wangi watsomlimila mighunda yake na kumpfunila ipfijo pfake. Katsowatenda iwanu wangi wamtendele tsisilaha tsa ing'ondo na wangi wamtendele ipfinu pfa imituka yake. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Katsowasola iwana wenu wapinga wawe iwotengenetsa mapfuta ighonung'ila, na wangi iwomwambikila ipfijo, na iwomwokela pfighate. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Katsoisola imighunda yenu inoghile, iwe mighunda yenu ya ipfijo, iwe mighunda yenu ya mitseituni, na mighunda yenu ya minzabibu na kuweng'a watumwa wake. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Katsosola fungu lya kumi mna ipfijo pfenu, na tsabibu tsenu, na kuweng'a iwakulu wake, na watumwa wake. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Katsowasola watumwa wenu wamale na mapinga, na ng'ombe na pfihongwe wenu iwanoghile ghendo na kuwatenda wamsang'anile. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Katsosola fungu lya kumi mna imifugho yenu, namwe mtsakuwa watumwa wake. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Ghamatsuwa agho, mwemwe mtsolila kwa ghamaghayo ghamtsopata kulawa kwa mfalume yamwisaghulile mwemwe muwenyegho, lekeni IMNDEWA ng'atsowedika baye.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Iwanu ng'awamtegheletse baye Samweli, walonga, “Baye! Twobama tuwe na mfalume, <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />ili na twetwe tuwe ka isi tsingi. Mfalume wetu yatulongotse na kututowela mna tsing'ondo tsetu.” <verse eid="1SA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Samweli hayahulike ghose ghawalongile, naye kaghenda kumlongela IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Samweli, “Wategheletse na uwasaghulile mfalume.” Kuya Samweli kawalongela Waisiraeli woye ukaye, chila munu ukaye yake.<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli ketingana na Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Mna likabila lya Benjamini, tsahana munu yumwe yana mali nyingi iyakemighwe Kishi. Yeye tsa mwana wa Abieli, na mtsukulu wa Serori, na chilembwe wa Bakorati, iyolawila mna lukolo lwa Afia mna likabila lya Benjamini iyamanyike sideke. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Kishi tsakana mwana mmale, taghwa lyake Sauli. Sauli tsakanogha, na kuduhu imunu mna isi ya Isiraeli iyanoghile ka yeye. Sauli tsa mtali kubita wanu wose mna isi ya Isiraeli.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Tsuwa limwe, pfihongwe wa Kishi tsawagha, kuya Kishi kamlongela mwanaghe Sauli, “Msole mtumighwa yumwe, mghende mkawabame wapfihongwe.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Nawo waghenda kuwabama mna isi ya ipfidunda ya Efraimu, na wabita mna isi ya Shalisha, lekeni ako ng'awawonile baye. Kuya waghenda mna isi ya Shaalimu, ako nako ng'awawonile baye. <verse eid="1SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Hawapfikile mna isi ya Sufu, Sauli kamlongela imtumighwa wake, “Tuye ukaye, hela aba wangu katsoleka ukwalangula wapfihongwe yatwalangule twetwe.”<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Imtumighwa kamwidika, “Beta chidogho, mna ghumji aghuno kuna munu wa Imulungu iyotogholighwa ng'ani, chila chayolonga cholawila ghendo, lelo tumghendele, songaha kodaha kutulongela tughende ubali wachi.”<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Sauli kamghutsa, “Tung'amghendela tutsomwing'a choni? Lola, ipfijo pfatutsile napfo pfimala na twahela chinu chochose cha kumwing'a imunu ayo wa Imulungu. Tuna choni?”<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Imtumighwa ayula kamwidika Sauli, “Lola, nina chihande chidogho cha pfesa, nitsomwing'a imunu ayo wa Imulungu ili yatulongele kwani kwatutsowona wapfihongwe.”<verse eid="1SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />Ghumwande mna isi ya Isiraeli imunu yang'abama kumlomba Imulungu, tsakalonga, “Haya tuke kwa mtowa lamli.” Kwaapfila imunu iyakemighwe nabii mna ghamatsuwa aghano ghumwande tsakakemighwa mlaghutsi. <verse eid="1SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Sauli kamwidika, “Kulonga ghoya, haya tuke.” Apfo waghenda mna ghumji aghula ghwayang'ali yokala imunu ayula wa Imulungu. <verse eid="1SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Hawang'ali wogheluka kughenda kuna ghumji, wetingana na wandele woghenda kudegha matsi. Wawaghutsa iwali awo, “Pfihi hana mlaghutsi ahano?”<verse eid="1SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Iwandele awala wawedika, “Ona, kabaho. Kahambele henu, mng'aghenda himahima mtsompfika. Katsa leloli kwaapfila leloli iwanu watsotambika ako kuna hanu ha ukutambikila. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Hamkwingila mna ghumji, mtsompfika, yeye ng'ana yaghende baye yakaje ako kwawotambikila. Kwaapfila iwanu ng'awatsakuja baye mbaka yeye yatambike, baho iwanu iwakemighwe nawo watsakuja. Apfo mghende himahima, mtsetingana naye.” <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Apfo Sauli na mtumighwa wake wagheluka kuna ghumji. Hawang'ali wakwingila mna ghumji, wamwona Samweli kowatsila, naye yang'ali yoghenda hanu ha ukutambikila.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Lelo digholo yake, ng'ana Sauli yapfike baye, IMNDEWA kamlongela apfino Samweli, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Ilupfi chipindi ka achino, nitsokughalila munu kulawa kuna isi ya Benjamini, naghwe kutsombaka mapfuta yawe mtawala wa iwanu wangu wa Isiraeli. Yeye katsowakombola iwanu wangu kulawa kwa Wafilisti, kwaapfila niwona iwanu wangu pfawodununzika, na chililo chawo chinipfikila.”<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Samweli hayamwonile Sauli, IMNDEWA kamlongela. “Ayuno yuyo imunu ayula yanikulongele mbuli tsake. Yeye yuyo iyatsowatawala iwanu wangu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Kuya Sauli kamsoghelela Samweli iyakalile habehi na lilango lya ghumji kamghutsa, “Nokulomba nilanguse ing'anda ya mlaghutsi.”<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samweli kamwidika, “Nene yuyo imlaghutsi. Mlongole mghende hanu ha ukutambikila, kwaapfila leloli mtsakuja na nene. Ilupfi nemitondo nitsokuleka uke ukaye yako, na nitsokulongela ghose ighali mmoyo mwako. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Na awala wapfihoghwe iwaghile tangia jutsi, uleke kuwalangula, awo woneka. Angu Waisiraeli yuhi iwombama ghendo? Apfi si ghweghwe baye na ikaye ya aba wako yose?”<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sauli kamwidika, “Nene nolawa mna likabila lya Benjamini ghendo, kabila dodo kubita makabila ghose mna ghamakabila gha Isiraeli. Na lukolo lwangu ludodo ghendo kubita kolo tsose itsili mna likabila lya Banjamini. Ule lelo konongela apfo?”<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Kuya Samweli kamghala kuchikuta Sauli na mtumighwa wake, kaweka hanu hawokala iwakulu, kwawakalile iwanu iwakemighwe. Tsahana wanu iwopfika salasini iwakemighwe. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Samweli kamlongela imunu yakwambika, “Ngalile lihunde lya inyama lyanikwing'ile, alila lyanikulongele ulike hambali.” <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Imunu ayula iyakwambika kaghenda kaghala lihatsa, keka hambele ha Samweli. Samweli kamlongela Sauli, “Lola achi chicho chawikilighwe ghweghwe, lelo chikighwa hambele hako. Uje kwaapfila nikwikila ghweghwe ahala haning'ali niwakema iwagheni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 9:24">Apfo litsuwa alila Sauli kaja hamwe na Samweli. <verse eid="1SA 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Hawahulumke kulawa hanu ha ukutambikila na kupfika kuna ghumji, Samweli kalonga na Sauli hayang'ali mkano kwayawasile.<verse eid="1SA 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli kombaka mapfuta Sauli yawe mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Nemitondotondo, kuko mkano Samweli kamkema Sauli, “Lamka nikuwaghe uke ukaye.” Sauli kalamka, na wose weli yeye na Samweli, walawa kunze woka. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Hawapfikile kuna ghumbaka ghwa ghumji, Samweli kamlongela Sauli, “Mlongele imsongolo ayo yalongole.” Imsongolo ayula hayokile, Samweli kamlongela Sauli, “Beta chidogho nikulongele aghala ghayalongile Imulungu.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Kuya Samweli kasola supa ya ghamapfuta kamghidila Sauli mwitwi, kamnonela kamlongela, “IMNDEWA kakubaka ghamapfuta uwe mtawala wa iwanu wake. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Leloli hatwitsehagha, kwitsetingana na wanu weli habehi na likabuli lya Raheli ako Selisa mna isi ya Benjamini. Iwanu awo watsokulongela ka wapfihongwe awala waung'ali uwabama woneka. Aba wako kaleka kuwalangula wapfihongwe iwaghile na sambi kokwalangula ghweghwe, na keghutsa ‘Nendetse nimpate mwanangu?’ <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Kulawa aho kutsoghenda kuna ghumbiki ghwa mwaloni ighuli Tabori, kuko kwitsetingana na wamale wadatu mnzila woghenda kumlapfila Imulungu nambiko ako Beteli. Munu yumwe kana mene wadowado wadatu, wakeli kakinda pfighate pfidatu, na wakadatu kakinda supa ya dipfai. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Nawo watsokulamsa na kukwing'a pfighate pfili, naghwe kutsopfibokela. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Kuya hautsopfika ako Gibea ya Imulungu kuna indalo ya maasikali wa Wafilisti, hautsopfika habehi na ghumji, kwitsetingana na manabii wengi iwohulumka kulawa hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila aku wotowa pfinubi, pfigoma, pfimbeta na zeze, aku wotabili. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Ghumuhe ghwa IMNDEWA katsokutsila kwa ngupfu, naghwe kutsotabili hamwe nawo, naghwe kutsoghalambuka na kuwa munu yungi. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Aho haghatsolawila agho, utende chochose chaukona chinogha, kwaapfila Imulungu ka hamwe naghwe. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Kuya unongolele, uhulumke, ughende kuna ghumji ghwa Giligali, na nene nitsakutsa kuko kulapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa na nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba. Kutsonibeta kuko kwa matsuwa saba mbaka nitse nikulanguse cha ukutenda.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Sauli hayahunduke yoke, Imulungu kaghutenda ghumoyo ghwa Sauli ghughalambuke. Aghala ghose ghayalongile Samweli ghalawila mna litsuwa lilyo. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Sauli na mtumighwa wake hawapfikile ako Gibea, kabokelighwa na manabii wengi. Ghumuhe ghwa Imulungu kamtsila kwa ngupfu na Sauli kandusa kutabili hamwe na manabii awo. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Iwanu wose iwammanyile Sauli kulawa ghumwande hawamwonile kotabili, weghutsa, “Chinu chachi ichimpatile mwana wa Kishi? Angu Sauli naye kayumwe wa manabii?” <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Imunu yumwe, iyang'ali yokala aho, kalonga, “Apfi aba wawo nani?” Apfo kulawila ng'ungo ilongile, “Apfi naye Sauli kayumwe wa manabii?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Sauli hayamalitse ukutabili, kaghenda hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikikila.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Aba wake mdodo Sauli hayamwonile Sauli na mtumwa wake, kawaghutsa, “Tsamghendile kwani?” Sauli kamwidika, “Tsatughenda kuwabama pfihongwe, na hatwonile ng'atuwona baye, tughenda kwa Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Aba mdodo wa Sauli kamlongela, “Chonde chonde, nongele chayakulongele Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Sauli kamwidika, “Katulongela ka wapfihongwe woneka.” Lekeni Sauli ng'amlongele ka Samweli tsakamlongela katsakuwa mfalume.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kotangatsighwa mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Apfo Samweli kawakema iwanu wose wetingane hambele ha IMNDEWA ako Mispa. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Hawapfikile kawalongela, “IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, kolonga apfino, ‘Niwalapfa mwemwe Waisiraeli mna isi ya Misiri, niwakombola kulawa kwa Wamisiri na iwanu wose iwawadununze. <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Lekeni leloli mndema nene Imulungu wenu yaniwakombole kulawa mna ukughaya kwenu na mna ukudununzika kwenu, namwe mlonga, baye! Twing'e mfalume yatulongotse. Lelo mtse hambele hangu kwa makabila ghenu, na kwa kolo tsenu.’”<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Kuya Samweli kaghaghala habehi makabila ghose gha Isiraeli, na IMNDEWA kalisaghula likabila lya Benjamini kwa kwasa simbi. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Kalighala hambele likabila lya Benjamini, kwa kulola tsikolo tsake, pfatsili na lukolo lwa Matiri lusaghulighwa kwa kwasa simbi. Kuya kawaghala hambele iwana wamale wa Matiri. Na Sauli imwana wa Kishi kasaghulighwa. Lekeni hawambamile ng'awamwonile baye. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Wamghutsa keli IMNDEWA, “Pfihi imunu ayo ma kapfika ahano?” IMNDEWA kawedika, “Ona kabaha, lekeni kepfisa ahala hana imitsigho.”<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Apfo watsuma, wambama Sauli na hawamwonile wamghala kuna iwanu. Sauli hayemile mghati mwa iwanu, tsamtali kubita iwanu wose. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Samweli kawalongela iwanu wose, “Mwomwona? Ayu yuyo imunu iyasaghulighwe na IMNDEWA, mna iwanu wose, kuduhu imunu iyali ka yeye.” Iwanu wose wakemelela, “Imulungu yakwike mfalume!”<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Kuya Samweli kawalongela iwanu tsing'onde tsayatsotenda imfalume na aghala ghayatsobama wamtendele, kuya katsandika tsing'onde atso mchitabu na kachika hambele ya Imulungu. Kuya Samweli kawaleka iwanu woke, na chila munu koya ukaye yake. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Pfipfila, Sauli koya ukaye yake ako Gibea, aku kelongotsa na iwanu iwadahile ukwitowa, awala Imulungu iyalongile nawo mna imimoyo yawo. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Lekeni wanu wangi mbughilambughila, walonga, “Apfi imunu ayuno katsodaha kutukombola?” Tsawambetsa Sauli na ng'awamwing'ile nzawadi baye. Lekeni yeye kenyamala tulu.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kowahuma Waamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Mfalume Nahashi wa Waamoni kaghenda kughutsingila ghumji ghwa Yabeshi Gileadi. Na iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Yabeshi Gileadi wamlongela Nahashi, “Wilaghane na twetwe kuya na twetwe tutsokutumikila.”<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Lekeni Nahashi kawedika, “Nitselaghana namwe kwa chinu chimwe, nitsomng'ola chila yumwe wenu nenge yake ya kujilo, apfo nitsowaghela chinyala Waisiraeli wose hambele ha iwanu wa isi tsingi.”<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Iwabala wa Yabeshi wamlongela, “Twing'e matsuwa saba ili tuwatume wasenga mna isi yose ya Isiraeli. Ka kuduhu munu wowose wa kutukombola, twitselapfa kuna ghweghwe.”<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Iwasenga awala hawapfikile ako Gibeya kwayakalile Sauli, wawalongela iwanu mbuli atso na iwanu wose watula ndilo. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Lelo Sauli yang'ali yakuya kulawa kumghunda aku kawalongotsa wang'ombe wake, naye kaghutsa, “Iwanu awano wana choni? Heule wolila?” Nawo wamlongela tsimbuli tsawaghalile iwasenga awala kulawa Yabeshi. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Sauli hayahulike tsimbuli atso, Ghumuhe ghwa Imulungu kamtsila kwa ngupfu, naye kona maya sideke. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Kawasola ng'ombe weli kawaghanaghana pfihande, kawatuma wasenga wapfibititse pfihande apfo mna imibaka yose ya Isiraeli aku wang'ali wolonga, “Munu wowose iyolema kumuwinza Sauli na Samweli kuna ing'ondo, ng'ombe wake watsotendelighwa apfino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 11:7">Waisiraeli wapfuka kwaapfila IMNDEWA yang'awatendele apfino. Apfo iwanu wose walawa na wawa chinu chimwe. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Sauli kawatinganitsa Waisiraeli kuna ghumji ghwa Bezeki. Nawo wapetighwa wapfika wamale laki ndatu kulawa Isiraeli na wamale elufu selasini kulawa mna likabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Wawalongela iwasenga awala iwoyile kulawa Yabeshi, “Walongeleni apfino iwanu wa isi ya Yabeshi Gileadi, ‘llupfi, litsuwa halikwalika ng'ani, mtsokombolighwa.’ ” Iwanu wa Yabeshi hawahulike mbuli atso wadeng'elela ng'ani.<verse eid="1SA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Apfo wamlongela Nahashi, “Ilupfi twitseghala tuwenyegho kuna ghweghwe, naghwe kutsotutendela chochose chaukona chinogha.”<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Ilupfi yake iwanu hawang'ali wokalitsa indalo, Sauli kawabaghula iwanu makingili madatu, lupfilipfili wengila kuna tsindalo tsa aduwi tsawo, wawatowa Waamoni. Haipfikile nemihe wanu wengi wakomighwa. Awala iwahonile wapwililika, chila munu katsuma yaliyeka.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Kuya Waisiraeli wamlongela Samweli, “Walikwani iwanu iwalongile Sauli yaleke kuwa mfalume wetu? Tughalile iwanu awo, tuwakome.”<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Lekeni Sauli kawalongela, “Leloli kuduhu munu iyatsokomighwa, kwaapfila litsuwa alino IMNDEWA kawakombola Waisiraeli.” <verse eid="1SA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Samweli kawalongela, “Wose tukeni Giligali na twikelaghane keli ka Sauli yuyo mfalume wetu.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Iwanu wose waghenda Giligali, na hawapfikile ako, welaghana hambele ha IMNDEWA ka Sauli yuyo mfalume. Wamlapfila IMNDEWA nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba. Naye Sauli hamwe na iwanu wa Isiraeli wadeng'elela ng'ani.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Samweli kowahagha Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Kuya Samweli kawalongela Waisiraeli wose, “Nighategheletsa ghose ghamnongele, na nene nimwing'ani mfalume. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Lelo mwinaye imfalume wa kuwalongotsa. Nene nilala na nina mvi, na iwanangu wamale wahamwe namwe. Niwa chilongotsi wenu kulawa haning'ali msongolo mbaka leloli. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Nene na ahano, ka nenda lyolyose lihile, mlonge hambele ha IMNDEWA na hambele ha imfalume wake iyamsaghule. Apfi niboka ng'ombe au chihongwe wa imunu wowose? Pfihi nimghutsukila munu wowose? Pfihi nimdununza munu wowose? Angu nibokela hongo kulawa kwa munu wowose ili ndeke kuhigha ghoya? Yalonge na nene nitsomuyitsila.”<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Iwanu wamwidika, “Mbe, ng'utughutsukile baye, wala ng'utudununze, wala ng'usolile baye chinu chochose kulawa kwa munu wowose.”<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Samweli kawedika, “IMNDEWA ka mkalangama wenu na mfalume wake iyamsaghule ka mkalangama ka mmbona nahela chinu chihile chanendile.” Nawo wamwidika, “Yeye yuyo imkalangama.”<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Samweli kaghendelela ukulonga, “IMNDEWA yuyo iyamsaghule Musa na Aruni na kuwalapfa wahenga wenu mna isi ya Misiri. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Lelo mwime baho hamli nene niwalonge mwemwe hambele ha IMNDEWA, kwa kuwalogela tsimbuli tsa ghamatendo ghake ighanoghile ghayatendile ili yawakombole mwemwe na iwahenga wenu. <verse eid="1SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Yakobu na iwanu wa ikaye yake hawaghendile Misiri, na Wamisiri hawawadununze mwemwe, wahenga wenu wamlilila IMNDEWA, naye kawatuma Musa na Aruni nawo wawalapfa iwahenga wenu mna isi ya Misiri na kuwatenda mkale mna isi aino. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Lekeni wawo wamsemwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wawo, naye kawaghela mna ghamoko gha Sisera, imkulu wa maasikali wa Hazori, na mna ghamoko gha Wafilisti na mna ghamoko gha mfalume wa Moabu. Iwanu wa tsiisi atso tsawetowa na iwabala wenu na kuwahuma. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Iwahenga wenu wamlilila IMNDEWA, walonga, ‘Tutenda nzambi kwa kukuleka ghweghwe IMNDEWA, na kwa kutumikila milungu ya Mabaali na Maashitaroti. Lelo tukombole na awala iwotuhila twetwe, na twetwe tutsokutumikila ghweghwe!’ <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Na IMNDEWA kawatuma Yerubaali, Baraka, Yefta, na hambele kanituma nene Samweli, ili chila yumwe wetu yawakombole kulawa mna iwanu iwowahila iwawatsunguluke, namwe tsamkala bila ukwitowa. <verse eid="1SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />Lekeni hammwonile mfalume Nahashi wa Waamoni katsa kuwatowa, mumlema IMNDEWA iyali mfalume wenu, mnongela, ‘Baye! Twombama mfalume yatulongotse.’ <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Lelo mfalume yamwisaghulile ayuno ahano. Tsamumlomba IMNDEWA yamwing'eni mfalume, naye kamwing'eni. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Mng'ampfuka IMNDEWA na kumtumikila yeye, na kumtegheletsa achila chayolonga, bila kuleka kughakinda malaghitso ghake, mwemwe hamwe na mfalume iyowalongotsani mng'amuwinza IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, mtsobweda. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Lekeni ka ng'amumtegheletsa IMNDEWA, na mwoleka ukukinda malaghitso ghake, yeye katsowadununza ka pfayawadununze iwahenga wenu. <verse eid="1SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />Lelo mwime na mwone kwa nenge tsenu chinu chikulu IMNDEWA chayatsochitenda hambele henu. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Apfi sambi si msimu ghwa chiyangatsi baye, msimu wa ukupfuna ingano? Lekeni nene nitsomlomba IMNDEWA yaghale ladu na imvula. Namwe mtsotanga na ukwona ghehile ghenu ghamtendile pfaghali makulu hambele ha IMNDEWA kwa ukwibamila wenyegho mfalume.”<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Kuya Samweli kamlomba IMNDEWA, na mna litsuwa lilyo IMNDEWA katuma ladu na mvula. Iwanu wampfuka ng'ani IMNDEWA na Samweli. <verse eid="1SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Apfo wamlongela Samweli, “Chonde chonde, tulombele twetwe watumighwa wako kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, tuleke kufa, kwaapfila tutotsa ng'ani kwa ukwibamila wenyegho imfalume.”<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samweli kawedika, “Mleke ukupfuka, hata ka mtenda ghehile ghose aghano, mleke ukuleka kumuwinza IMNDEWA, lekeni mtumikileni kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghose. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Mleke kuiwinza milungu ya ughutsu ilihela chinu wala ng'aidaha baye ukuwakombola, kwaapfila ng'aidaha baye kuwapfila. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Kwa taghwa lyake kulu, IMNDEWA ng'atsowaleka baye iwanu wake kwaapfila pfimnoghela IMNDEWA kuwatenda mwemwe muwe iwanu wake. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Kuna nene ng'aitsolawila ghendo baye nimtendelele nzambi IMNDEWA kwa kuleke kuwalombelani mwemwe. Nitsoghendelela kuwalangulitsa nzila inoghile na igholoke. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Lelo mwemwe mumpfuke IMNDEWA na kumtumikila pfinoghile kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghose. Mleke kwisemwa aghala ghamakulu ghayawatendeleni. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Lekeni mng'aghendelela ukutenda ghehile, mtsohupa ghendo mwemwe na mfalume wenu.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Sauli koleka ukumuhulikitsa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Sauli hayawile mfalume tsakana miyaka selasini. Na kawalongotsa Waisiraeli kwa miyaka alubaini na mili. <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Sauli kawasaghula Waisiraeli elufu ndatu. Mna wawo, wanu elufu mbili tsawakala na Sauli ako Mikimashi mna isi ya pfidunda pfa Beteli. Na wanu elufu imwe wakala na Yonasani mna ghumji ghwa Gibea kuna isi Benjamini. Na awala iwasighale kawaleka chila munu yoye ukaye yake.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yonasani kawatowa maasikali wa Wafilisti wose iwekile ndalo ako Gibea. Nawo Wafilisti wahulika imbuli ayo. Apfo Sauli katowa malati mna isi yose kalonga, “Lelo Waeburaniya wahulike!” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Waisiraeli wose wahulika ka Sauli kowatowa maasikali wa Wafilisti, na ka lelo Wafilisti wowehila ng'ani Waisiraeli. Apfo iwanu wakemighwa waghende wakelunge na Sauli ako Giligali.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Apfo Wafilisti wetingana hamwe waitowe Isiraeli, aku wana mituka ya ng'ondo elufu ndatu, maasikali elufu sita iwodina falasi, na maasikali iwoghenda kwa maghulu tsa wawengi ka msanga ghwa kumwani. Awano wose tsawagheluka na kwika ndalo yawo Mikimashi ubali wa mashaliki mwa ghumji ghwa Beti Aveni. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Waisiraeli hawonile woghaya, kwaapfila wang'ali wotowighwa ng'ani, tsawanza kwipfisa. Wamwenga wepfisa mna tsimango, wamwenga mwibagho, wamwenga mna ghamabambalawe, wamwenga mna ghamapondo, na wamwenga twepfisa mna ipfisima ipfilihela ghamatsi. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Wamwenga waloka ghumto Yoridani mbaka wapfika mna isi ya Gadi na mna isi ya Gileadi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Lekeni Sauli tsayang'ali ako Giligali, na iwanu wose iwamuinzile wang'ali woghudema. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Sauli kambeta Samweli kwa matsuwa saba ka Samweli pfayalongile. lekeni Samweli ng'atsile baye ako Giligali na iwanu wandusa kumleka Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Kuya Sauli kawalongela iwanu, “Ngalileni nambiko tsenu tsa ukulakatsighwa na nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba.” Naye kalapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa.<verse eid="1SA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Naye hayamalitse ukulapfa inambiko, Samweli kapfika. Sauli kaghenda kumbokela Samweli na kumlamsa. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Samweli kaghutsa, “Utendile choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Sauli kamwidika, “Hambonile iwanu wondeka, naghwe ng'utsile baye mna ghamatsuwa saba ghaulongile, na hambonile Wafilisti wetanda kwa ing'ondo ako Mikimashi, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />nyalangula watsakutsa kunitowa ako Giligali. Tsasina nilombe baye IMNDEWA yatutendele uluso. Apfo nilamla nilapfe nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa.”<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Samweli kamwidika Sauli, “Kutenda ubotsi. Ng'umhulikitse baye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako. Ung'amhulikitse, yang'akulekile ghweghwe na watsukulu wako muilongotse isi ya Isiraeli ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Lekeni lelo ufalume wako ng'utsoghendelela baye, kwaapfila ng'umhulikitse baye IMNDEWA. IMNDEWA kebamila munu yungi iyomnoghela mmoyo, ayo yuyo iyamsaghule yawe mtawala wa iwanu wake.”<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Baho Samweli kalawa Giligali kaghenda Gibeya mna isi ya Benjamini. Na Sauli hayawapetile iwanu iwakalile hamwe naye, tsawapfika wanu miya sita. <verse eid="1SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Sauli na Yonasani imwanaghe, hamwe na iwanu iwakalile hamwe nawo, wakala ako Gibeya mna isi ya Benjamini, na Wafilisti weka ndalo ako Mikimashi. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Wafilisti tsawalawa kuna indalo yawo na waghenda kuwatowa aku wa makingili madatu. Kingili limwe tsalighenda Ofura mna isi ya Shuali. <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />Kingili lingi tsalighenda Beti Horoni, na kingili lingi tsalighenda ulwanda lwa Seboimu kughenda kunyika.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Ghamatsuwa agho tsakuduhu muhunzi mna isi yose ya Isiraeli, kwaapfila Wafilisti wang'ali wowaghoma Waeburaniya waleke kwitengenetsela mapanga au migoha. <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Waisiraeli wose tsakaghenda kwa Wafilisti kunola ghembe lyake, maghembe gha ukukweghighwa na wang'ombe, hoya yake, au nyengo. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Waisiraeli wang'ali woliha pfihande pfili pfa fetsa kwa kunola ghembe na sululu. Na tsawaliha chihande chimwe kwa kunola hoya na nyengo. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Apfo mna litsuwa lya ing'ondo kuduhu munu mna iwanu iwakalile hamwe na Sauli na Yonasani imwanaghe yaghalile lipanga au mgoha ila Sauli na Yonasani imwanaghe waliyeka.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Wafilisti waghala kingili lya maasikali waghenda kubetetsa ing'alo ya Mikimashi.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Yonasani na imsongolo wake wowakoma Wafilisti wengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Tsuwa limwe, Yonasani mwana wa mfalume Sauli kamlongela msongolo yamghalile ipfinu pfa ukwitowela, “Utse, tughende kumwambu kuna indalo ya Wafilisti.” Lekeni Yonasani ng'amlongele baye aba wake. <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Sauli tsakakala mna ichimbeho cha mbiki ghwa mkomamanga ako Migironi, kunze mwa isi ya Gibea, na iwanu iwakalile hamwe naye tsa miya sita. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Mna wawo tsakabaho Ahiya iyapfalile chitsibao cha mtambika, yeye tsakakala mwana wa Ahitibu ndughu yake Ikabodi, iyakalile imwana wa Fenehasi, na mtsukulu wa Eli, mtambika wa IMNDEWA mna ghumji ghwa Shilo. Kuduhu munu wowose iyamanyile ka Yonasani tsakoka.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Mna ing'alo iyabamile kubita Yonasani yapfike ndalo ya Wafilisti, tsahana mabambalawe meli ighasongoke, ubali auno na ubali ungi. Bambalawe limwe tsalikemighwa Bosesi na lingi tsalikemighwa Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Bambalawe limwe tsalikala ubali wa kasikazini lyelolesa na ghumji ghwa Mikimashi, na lingi tsalikala ubali wa kusini lyelolesa na ghumji ghwa Gibea.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yonasani kamlongela imsongolo ayula iyaghalile ipfinu pfa ukwitowela “Utse, tughende ubali wa keli kuna indalo ya iwanu awano ing'awengile ngoma, songaa IMNDEWA katsotwapfila, kwaapfila kuduhu chinu cha kumtenda IMNDEWA yaleke kukombola, iwe kwa wanu wengi au wanu chidogho.”<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Imsongolo ayula kamlongela, “Tenda chochose chaubama, nene na hamwe naghwe kwa chochose chautenda.”<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yonasani kamlongela, “Tutsoloka kuwaghendela iwanu awala ili watwone. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Wang'atulongela, ‘Mbete baho mbaka twetwe tuwatsile,’ tutsakwima bahano hatuli na wala ng'atutsowaghendela baye. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Lekeni wang'alonga ‘Mwemwe mtse kwatuli twetwe,’ baho tutsowaghendela, kwaapfila acho chitsakuwa chitango ka IMNDEWA katsowaghela mna ghamoko ghetu.”<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Apfo Yonasani na imsongolo ayula tsawalawa ili Wafilisti wawone. Kuya Wafilisti walonga, “Lola, Waeburaniya awala, wolawa mna ghamapondo mwawepfisile.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Wafilisti iwakalile mna indalo tsawamkema Yonasani na imsongolo ayula walonga, “Mgheluke akuno kuna twetwe, namwe mtsochona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Yonasani kamlongela imsongolo ayula, “Haya niwinze, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kawaghela mna ghamoko gha Isiraeli!” <verse eid="1SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Kuya Yonasani kagheluka uchanya kwa kukwalina na imsongolo ayula kamuwinza kuchughu. Wafilisti waghwa hambele ha Yonasani, na imsongolo ayula yang'ali yowakoma. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Apfo Yonasani na imsongolo wake, wawakoma wanu iwopfika ishilini mna ichibwalu ichipfika nusu heka. Ayo tsaikala ng'ondo ya mwanduso. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Mna isi yose ya Wafilisti, iwanu wose wandusa ukupfuka, asikali iwali kuna tsindalo, iwanu iwali mna imighunda, na iwanu iwali mna tsingome, na awala iwoboka ipfinu, nawo tsawadedema, na isi ihighisika. Apfo iwanu tsawapfuka ng'ani.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wafilisti watowighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Wapelembi wa Sauli ako Gibea mna isi ya Benjamini tsawawona iwanu wengi wotsuma akuno na akuno. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Sauli kawalongela iwanu iwakalile naye, “Mwipete tulole nani ing'ali baha.” Hawepetile tsawamanya ka Yonasani na imsongolo ayula iyaghalile ipfinu pfa ukwitowela tsa ng'awalibaho baye. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Sauli kamlongela mtambika Ahiya, “Lighale ahano lisanduku lya Imulungu.” Ghamatsuwa agho alyo tsawenalyo Waisiraeli. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Sauli hayang'ali yolonga na mtambika, tsakahulika iwanu woghendelela ukwowela kuna indalo ya Wafilisti. Apfo Sauli kamlongela mtambika Ahiya, “Wime, uleke kutenda chochose.” <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Apfo Sauli na iwanu wake wetanda kwitowa na Wafilisti. Lekeni Wafilisti wandusa ukwitowa wenyegho kwa wenyegho, na tsahana hengele kulu. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Waeburaniya awala iwakalile na Wafilisti kulawa ghumwande na iwaghendile nawo kuna indalo, waghalambuka na welunga na Waisiraeli iwakalile na Sauli na Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Pfipfila Waisiraeli wangi iwepfisile mna isi ya ipfidunda ya Efraimu, hawahulike ka wafilisti wang'ali wotsuma, nawo pfipfila wawawinza na kuwakoma.<verse eid="1SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Apfo IMNDEWA kawatenda Waisiraeli wahume. Ing'ondo tsayenela mbaka kubita Beti Aveni.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yonasani kakoneka kana totso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Litsuwa alila, Waisiraeli tsawaghanzika ng'ani kwaapfila Sauli kawalighita iwanu, kalonga, “Munu wowose iyatsakuja chijo ng'ana litsuwa liswe na ng'ana niwatowe iwanu wangu iwonihila, ayo yalighitighwe.” Apfo tsuwa lyose kuduhu imunu iyajile chijo chochose. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Na iwanu wose hawengile mna ghumuhulo tsawona uki wodwena chila hanu. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Ila haduhu munu iyajile uki awo kwaapfila tsawapfuka ukulighitighwa akula kwawalighitighwe.<verse eid="1SA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Lekeni Yonasani ng'amhulike baye aba wake ahala hayawalighite iwanu. Apfo kasola ng'weku kaipfabika mna lisegha lya uki, kuya kaja uki awo. Na baho kapata ngupfu. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Baho munu yumwe kamlongela, “Aba wako kawalighita iwanu kalonga, ‘Imunu wowose iyatsakuja ichijo leloli, ayo yalighitighwe.’ ” Apfino pfipfo iwanu pfawatsilike.<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yonasani kalonga, “Aba wangu kawadununza iwanu. Lelo nene nina ngupfu kwaapfila ndiya uki auno chidogho. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Iwanu wetu wang'ajile chidogho leloli kulawa mna ipfinu pfawabokile kwa awala iwowahila, tung'apatile ngupfu na Wafilisti wengi wang'akomighwe.”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Litsuwa alila, Waisiraeli wawatowa Wafilisti kulawa Mikimashi mbaka Aiyaloni. Lekeni waghendelela bila kuwa na ngupfu kwaapfila tsawepfa ng'ani. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Apfo watsumila ipfinu pfawabokile. Tsawawasola wang'olo, ng'ombe na ngo'mbe wadodo, wawasubutula, waja inyama na idamu. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Iwanu wangi wamlongela Sauli, “Lola iwanu womtotsela IMNDEWA kwa ukuja inyama ine idamu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Sauli kawalongela iwanu, “Mwemwe mtenda pfihile, bimbiliseni libwe kulu litse ahano hana nene.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Kuya kawalongela, “Ghendeni mkawalongele iwanu wose wangalile ahano wang'ombe wawo au wang'olo wawo, wawasubutule na kuwaja ahano. Waleke kumtotsela IMNDEWA kwa ukuja inyama ina idamu.” Apfo chilo achila tsawawaghala aho wang'ombe wawo na wawasubutula baho. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Sauli tsakamtsengela IMNDEWA matsabahu. Ayo tsaikala matsabahu ya mwanduso Sauli iyamtsengele IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1SA 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Kuya Sauli kawalongela iwanu, “Lelo nechilo tukeni tuwawinze Wafilisti, tukawapfamile na kuwaboka tsimali tsawo mbaka nemitondo, na tuleke kumleka munu wowose yawe mghima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Iwanu wamlongela, “Tenda chochose chaukwona chinogha.” Lekeni mtambika kawalongela, “Leka tanu tumghutse IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Apfo Sauli kamghutsa IMNDEWA, “Pfihi ng'ende kuwatowa Wafilisti? Apfi kutsotutenda tuwahume Wafilisti?” Lekeni IMNDEWA ng'amwidike baye mna tsuwa alila. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Kuya Sauli kalonga, “Mtse ahano mwe muwakulu ili tulole nzambi yachi itendighwe leloli. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima na iyoikombola isi ya Isiraeli, hata ka imwanangu Yonasani, ayo yakomighwe.” Lekeni kuduhu munu iyalongile chinu. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Apfo Sauli kawalongela Waisiraeli wose, “Mwemwe mwose mwime akula, kuya nene na mwanangu Yonasani tutsakwima akuno.” Wawo wamwidika, “Utende chochose chaukwona chinogha.” <verse eid="1SA 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Sauli kalonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA wa Isiraeli, hebali ng'unyidika baye nene mtumighwa wako? Ghwe IMNDEWA wa Isiraeli, ka yanitotsile nene au mwanangu Yonasani, lelo ulamle kwa libwe lya Urimu. Lekeni ka iwatotsile iwanu wako wa Isiraeli, ulamle kwa libwe lya Thumimu.” Apfo Yonasani na Sauli woneka watotsa, lekeni iwanu woneka ng'awatotsile baye. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Kuya Sauli kalonga, “Haya lelo utowe simbi tsitulamle nene na mwanangu Yonasani, tulole yatotsile nani.” Na ghamabwe ghalangusa, iyatotsile Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Baho Sauli kamlongela Yonasani, “Nongele chautendile.” Yonasani kamwidika, “Tsandiya uki chidogho kwa ng'weku yangu. Lelo nobamighwa nife.”<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Sauli kalonga, “IMNDEWA yanidununze ng'ani ka ghweghwe Yonasani ng'autsakufa baye.”<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Lekeni iwanu wamlongela Sauli, “Hebali Yonasani yakomighwe, imunu iyaitendile isi ya Isiraeli ihume ghendo? Baye! Twelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mghima, hata lumvili lumwe lwa litwi lyake ng'alutsolaghala hasi baye. Chayatendile leloli, katenda kwaapfila IMNDEWA kamwapfila.” Apfo iwanu wamkombola Yonasani naye ng'akomighwe baye. <verse eid="1SA 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Kuya Sauli kaleka kuwawinza Wafilisti, nawo Wafilisti woya kuna isi yawo.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utawala wa Sauli na kaye yake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Sauli hayawile mfalume wa Isiraeli, tsaketowa na aduwi tsake chila hanu, Wamoabu, Waamoni, Waedomu, na wafalume wa Soba na Wafilisti. Na chila hanu hayetowile nawo, tsakawahuma. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Tsakadaha ukwitowa nawo bila kuwapfuka, na kawahuma Waamaleki, na kawakombola Waisiraeli kulawa kwa iwanu wose iwawaghoghile.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Iwana wamale wa Sauli wawo awano: Yonasani, Ishivi na Maliki Shua. Iwanaghe wapinga tsa waweli; chaudele tsakakemighwa Merabu na mdodo wake tsakakemighwa Mikali. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Ipinga wa Sauli tsakakemighwa Ahinoamu neghe Ahimaasi. Mkulu wa maasikali wa Sauli tsakakemighwa Abineri, mwana wa Neri, ayo Neri tsa mtumba wa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Aba wa Sauli tsakakemighwa Kishi, na aba wa Abineri tsakakemighwa Neri, awo wose weli tsawana wa Abieli.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Matsuwa ghose Sauli hayawile mfalume, tsaketowa ng'ani na Wafilisti. Sauli hayamwonile munu wowose kana ngupfu na kakengela tsakamwika mna maasikali wake.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kowatowa Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Samweli kamlongela Sauli, “IMNDEWA kanituma nikubakatse mapfuta uwe mfalume wa iwanu wake wa Isiraeli. Lelo tegheletsa mbuli ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />IMNDEWA yana ingupfu ng'ani kolonga, ‘Nitsowadununza Waamaleki kwaaapfila wawatowa Waisiraeli hawang'ali wolawa Misiri. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Lelo, ghenda ukawatowe na kupfihinya pfinu pfose pfawali napfo. Uleke kuwonela libatsi, uwakome wose, wamale, wapinga, iwana wadowado, iwana iwoghwawa, ng'ombe, wang'olo, ngamiya na pfihongwe.’”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Sauli kawakema iwanu wose, kawakaghula ako kuna ghumji ghwa Telaimu. Tsakuna maasikali laki mbili iwoghenda kwa maghulu, na elufu kumi kulawa kabila lya Yuda.<verse eid="1SA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Kuya Sauli na iwanu wake waghenda mna isi ya Amaleki, wakala kulwanda kuwapfisiya. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Sauli kawalongela Wakeni, “Mke! Laweni mwibaghule na Waamaleki, ndeke kuwakoma hamwe nawo. Mlawe kwaapfila mwemwe tsamuwatendela pfinoghile Waisiraeli hawalawile Misiri.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:6">Apfo Wakeni tsawoka, webaghula na Waamaleki. <verse eid="1SA 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Sauli kawatowa Waamaleki kwandusila Havila mbaka Shuri, ubali wa kumoso wa Misiri. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Tsakamghogha Agagi mfalume wa Waamaleki yang'ali ka mghima. Kawakoma iwanu wose kwa lipanga. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Lekeni Sauli na iwanu wake ng'awamkomile baye Agagi, wala wang'olo na wang'ombe iwanenehe, wala iwana wang'olo na iwana wa wang'ombe iwananene na chinu chochose ichoneke chinogha ng'awachihinyile baye. Lekeni pfose pfihile na ipfilihela sang'ano wapfihinya.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kolemighwa kughendelela kuwa mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Samweli, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Nakwona usungu kwa kumtenda Sauli yawe mfalume. Yeye kaleka kuniwinza na ng'oghakinda baye malaghitso ghangu.” Samweli kasing'inika, kamlilila IMNDEWA chilo chose. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Ilupfi yake, Samweli kalamka nemitondotondo kaghenda kwitingana na Sauli, lekeni munu yumwe kamlongela, “Sauli tsakaghenda Karimeli na kuko ketsengela imwenyegho mnala ghwa kumbukumbu yake na sambi koka, kaghenda Giligali.” <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Samweli hayampfikile Sauli, Sauli kamlongela Samweli, “IMNDEWA yakubaliki! Nikinda laghitso lya IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Samweli kamghutsa, “Mbona nohulika wang'olo na wang'ombe wolila?”<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sauli kamwidika, “Iwanu ng'awawakomile baye wang'olo na wang'ombe iwanenehe ng'ani iwawasolile kulawa kwa Wamaleki, wawaleka wamlapfile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako nambiko, lekeni wangi wose tuwakoma.”<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Samweli kamlongela Sauli, “Nyamale! Nitsokulongela imbuli iyanilongele IMNDEWA leloli nechilo.” Sauli kalonga, “Nongele.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samweli kamlongela, “Hata ka tsakwibona kwa mdodo, apfi ghweghwe ng'utendighwe baye mkulu wa ghamakabila gha Isiraeli? IMNDEWA kakubaka mapfuta uwe mfalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Kuya IMNDEWA hayakutumile kakulongela, ‘Ghenda ukawakome ghendo awala Waamaleki, awo wose wana nzambi, witowe nawo mbaka uwakome wose!’ <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Heule lelo, ng'umtegheletse IMNDEWA? Heule msumkila ukusola pfinu na ukutenda ghehile hambele ya IMNDEWA?”<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Sauli kamwidika, “Nimtegheletsa IMNDEWA. Tsang'enda akula kwanitumile IMNDEWA, nimleta Agagi mfalume wa Waamaleki na niwakoma ghendo Waamaleki. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Lekeni iwanu wasola pfinu, wang'olo, wamene, wang'ombe na pfinu pfose ipfinoghile ipfilapfighwe pfihinyighwe ili kumtambikila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako ako Giligali.”<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Naye Samweli kalonga, “Apfi IMNDEWA kobama ghendo nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa na nambiko kubita ukumtegheletsa yeye? Lola, pfinogha ukumtegheletsa yeye kubita kulapfa nambiko, na pfinogha kumtegheletsa yeye kubita kumlapfila mapfuta gha mvulati. <verse eid="1SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Ukulema kutegheletsa kweghala na inzambi ya uhawi, na chidandali cheghala na ghehile na kutamanila pfinyagho. Kwaapfila kulema lilaghitso lya IMNDEWA naye kakulema uleke kuwa mfalume.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Sauli kamlongela Samweli, “Nitotsa. Nileka laghitso lya IMNDEWA na laghitso lyako, kwaaapfila niwapfuka iwanu, niwahulikitsa wawo. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Lekeni sambi nokulomba, undeghusile totso lyangu. Ndeke mbuye naghwe, nidahe kumtamanila IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Samweli kamwidika, “Ndema, sidaha baye kuya hamwe naghwe. Ghweghwe kulema lilaghitso lya IMNDEWA, naye kakulema uleke kuwa mfalume wa Isiraeli.”<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Samweli hayahunduke yoke, Sauli kakindilisa libeme lya lighwanda lyake, nalo lidegheka. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Kuya Samweli kamlongela Sauli, “Kulawa leloli IMNDEWA kausola ufalume wa Isiraeli kulawa kuna ghweghwe na katsomwing'a munu yungi mna iwanu iwali habehi naghwe, iyanoghile kubita ghweghwe. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Imulungu yana ingupfu wa Isiraeli ng'oghutsuka baye, wala ng'oghalambuka baye. Yeye si munu baye mbaka yaghalambuke.”<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Sauli kamwidika, “Nitotsa. Lekeni nokulomba uleke kunihumbula hambele ha iwakulu wa iwanu wangu na Waisiraeli. Ndeke mbuye hamwe naghwe nikamtamanile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako.” <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Apfo Samweli koya hamwe na Sauli, na Sauli kamtamanila IMNDEWA.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Kuya Samweli kalonga, “Ngalileni ahano Agagi mfalume wa Waamaleki.” Agagi kamghendela aku kohighwa na ng'apfukile baye na kolonga,, “Usungu wa lifwa upfosa ghendo.” <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Samweli kalonga, “Ka lipanga lyako pfaliwatendile tsina mai wengi wana wawo wafe, naye mai wako imwanaghe katsakufa.” Kuya Samweli kamghanaghana Agagi pfihande hande hambele ha IMNDEWA ako Giligali.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Kuya Samweli kaghenda Rama na mfalume Sauli koya ukaye yake ako Gibeya ya Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Kulawa litsuwa alyo, Samweli ng'amwonile keli baye Sauli mbaka litsuwa hayafile. Lekeni Samweli yang'ali yomdomboketsela Sauli. Naye IMNDEWA kona usungu kwaapfila kamwika Sauli yawe mfalume wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Samweli kombakatsa mapfuta Daudi yawe mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />IMNDEWA kamghutsa Samweli, “Kutsomlilila Sauli mbaka tsuwachi? Ghweghwe komanya ka nene nimlema yaleke kuwa mfalume wa Isiraeli. Lelo, memetsa imembe mapfuta, uke. Nokutuma kwa Yese iyokala mna isi ya Betilehemu. Kwaapfila nimpata mfalume mna iwanaghe.”<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Samweli kalonga, “Nitsoghendatse? Sauli yang'ahulika imbuli aino, katsonikoma!” IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Usole ng'ombe pinga, ing'ana yeleke baye ughende naye, na ung'apfika ako ulonge, ‘Nitsa kumlapfila IMNDEWA nambiko.’ <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Mkeme Yese yatse kuna litambiko alyo na nene nitsokulangusa cha ukutenda. Kutsonibakila mapfuta ayula yanitsokulongela.”<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samweli katenda ka IMNDEWA pfayamlongele, kaghenda Betilehemu. Wakulu wa isi tsawalawa kumbokela aku wodedema, wamghutsa, “Pfihi kutsa tseghamba?” <verse eid="1SA 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Samweli kawedika, “Nitsa tseghamba. Nitsa kumlapfila IMNDEWA nambiko. Mwitende mwele kuya tughende kumlapfila IMNDEWA nambiko.” Samweli kamtenda Yese kela hamwe na iwanaghe. Kawakema kuna inambiko.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Nawo hawapfikile, na Samweli hayamwonile Eliabu kelongela imwenyegho mmoyo, “Mbakighwa mapfuta wa IMNDEWA yuyo ayuno ghendo iyali hambele ha IMNDEWA!” <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kamlongela Samweli, “Uleke kulolesa ichihanga chake, wala chimo chake. Nene nimlema, kwaapfila silolesa baye ka iwanu pfawololesa. Imunu kololesa kwakunze, lekeni nene nololesa mna ghumoyo.”<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Kuya Yese kamkema Abinadabu na kumghala hambele ya Samweli. Lekeni Samweli kalonga, “Ayu ng'asaghulighwe baye na IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Yese tsakamghala Shama. Samweli kalonga, “Wala ayuno ng'asaghulighwe baye na IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Yese kawaghala iwanaghe wose saba hambele ha Samweli, lekeni Samweli kamlongela, “IMNDEWA ng'amsagule baye munu wowose mna awano.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Kuya Samweli kamghutsa Yese, “Pfihi wanagho wose wabahano?” Yese kamwidika, “Mbe, imwana mdodo ng'alibaha baye, kaghenda kudima wang'olo.” Samweli kamlongela, “Mtume munu yamkeme, twetwe ng'atutsokala hasi tuje baye mbaka hayatsakutsa ahano.”<verse eid="1SA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Apfo Yese kamlaghitsa munu, naye katsa naye. Imsongolo ayula tsamdung'u, nenge tsake tsinogha, na lukuli lwake ludegheta. IMNDEWA kamlongela Samweli, “Lelo, ayu yuyo yeye, winuke umbake ghamapfuta.” <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Samweli kasola imembe ina ghamapfuta kambaka Daudi mapfuta hambele ha ndughu tsake. Bahala Muhe wa IMNDEWA kamtsila Daudi kwa ngupfu, kakala naye tangia litsuwa alyo na kughendelela. Kuya Samweli koya Rama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kamna libalatsa lya Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Baho Ghumuhe ghwa IMNDEWA kamleka Sauli, na muhe yehile itumighwe na IMNDEWA tsaimtsupfa. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Watumwa wake Sauli wamlongela, “Twomanya ka muhe yehile kulawa kwa IMNDEWA kokutsupfa. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Lelo, ghwe mtwatsa wetu, laghitsa watumighwa wako iwokutumikila wambame imunu iyodaha kutowa ching'weng'we, na ayo muhe yehile kulawa kwa Imulungu hayatsakutsa, imunu ayo katsotowa ching'weng'we, naghwe kutsohona.”<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Sauli kawalongela iwatumighwa wake, “Nibamileni imunu ayo iyodaha kutowa iching'weng'we pfinoghile, mngalile.”<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Imtumighwa wake yumwe kalonga, “Nimwona mwana wa Yese, iyokala Betilehemu, ayo kadaha kutowa ching'weng'we. Imsongolo ayo kakengela na kana ngupfu ya kwitowa mna ing'ondo, kolonga pfinoghile na kanogha, na IMNDEWA kahamwe naye.”<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Apfo Sauli kaghala nume kwa Yese, kalonga, “Ngalile imwanagho Daudi, iyodima wang'olo na wamene.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Yese kamghala Daudi kwa Sauli, naye kaghenda na mene mdodo na chihongwe iyamtwikile pfighate, na chiliba chimemile dipfai. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Daudi hayapfikile kamtumikila Sauli. Sauli kamkunda ng'ani Daudi, na kamsaghula yamghalile silaha tsake. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Kuya Sauli kamtumila nume Yese kalonga, “Nomkunda Daudi, mleke yakale na nene yanitumikile.” <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Chila imuhe ayula yehile kulawa kwa Imulungu hayamtsile Sauli, Daudi kasola iching'weng'we chake na kuchitowa, imuhe ayo yehile kamleka Sauli, naye kahona.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Goliati kowatambila Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Ghamatsuwa agho Wafilisti wawatinganitsa hamwe maasikali wawo kwa ukwitowa ako Soko, ghumji ighuli mna isi ya Yuda. Weka ndalo yawo Efesi Damimu, haghati ha Soko na Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Sauli hamwe na Waisiraeli tsawetingana, na weka indalo yawo mna ichidunda wololesa ulwanda lwa Ela. Tsawatiyali ukwitowa na Wafilisti. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Wafilisti tsawema mna chidunda chimwe na Waisiraeli wema kuna chidunda chingi, haghatighati tsahana lwanda.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Kulawa mna indalo ya Wafilisti, tsakulawila munu yumwe iyana ngupfu, iyakemighwe Goliati, imunu wa ghumji ghwa Gati. Utali wake wopfika futi tisa. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Mwitwi tsakapfala kofia ya shaba, na mmambagha tsakapfala chinu cha kumkinga chine kilo hamsini na saba. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Mmaghulu mwake tsakapfala chinu cha shaba ka magome gha ukumkinga, na mmayegha mwake tsakabapa mgoha ghwa shaba. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Muhini ghwa mgoha ghwake tsa ghwighala na mfumanguo na litwi lya ghumgoha aghwo tsaghuna kilo saba. Ngawo yake tsaidutighwa na munu yungi iyamlongolele. <verse eid="1SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Goliati kema kawakemelela maasikali wa Isiraeli, kalonga, “Aho mtenda choni? Angu mtsa ukwitowa? Nene na Mfilisti, mwemwe mwa watumwa wa Sauli. Saghuleni munu yumwe yatse yetowe na nene. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Yang'anitowa na kunikoma, twetwe tutsakuwa watumwa wenu. Lekeni ning'amtowa na kumkoma, mwemwe mtsakuwa watumwa wetu na kututumikila.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Kuya Mfilisti ayo kalonga kwa kutamba, “Leloli nowaligha maasikali wa Isiraeli! Mlapfeni munu yumwe yatse yetowe na nene.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Sauli hamwe na iwanu wose wa Isiraeli hawahulike tsimbuli atso tsa Mfilisti, tsawaghudema na wapfuka ng'ani.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kowaghalila ipfijo ndughu tsake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Daudi tsa mwana wa Yese iyalawile mna ilukolo lwa Efurati iyakemighwe Yese, iyakalile Betilehemu mna isi ya Yuda. Yese tsakana wana wamale wanane. Sauli hayang'ali ka mfalume, Yese tsakalala ghendo. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Iwana wakulu wadatu wa Yese, tsawaghenda na Sauli ukwitowa. Imwanaghe chaudele kakemighwa Eliabu, na wa keli Abinadabu na wa kadatu Shama, <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />na Daudi tsa mtsuwanda wawo. Iwana awala wadatu wakulu hawaghendile na Sauli kung'ondo, <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Daudi yang'ali yoghendagha kwayali Sauli, na yang'ali yakuyagha ukaye Betilehemu kudima wang'olo wa aba wake.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Kwa matsuwa alubaini, Mfilisiti ayula yang'ali yolawa kunze nemitondo na nemihe kuwatambila Waisiraeli.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Tsuwa limwe Yese kamlongela mwanaghe Daudi, “Waghalile ndughu tsako madanu aghano kilo kumi na pfighate apfino kumi. Waghalile sambi baha ako kuna indalo yawo. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Na imkulu ayula iyolongotsa maasikali elufu imwe mghalile pfihande kumi apfino pfa jibini. Kawalole ndughu tsako ka woghendelela pfinoghile kuya utse unongele pfawoghendelela. <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Mfalume Sauli na ndughu tsako, na iwamale wose wa Isiraeli wa mna ulwanda lwa Ela, wetowa na Wafilisti.” <verse eid="1SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Daudi kalamka nemitondotondo, na kamlekela imdimi wang'olo. Kasola ichijo na kaghenda ka pfayalaghitsighwe na aba wake Yese. Hayapfikile kuna indalo ya Waisiraeli, tsakawapfika Waisiraeli wolawa waghende wakeme mna imisululo yawo ukwitowa, na wang'ali wokemelela ilitsi lya ing'ondo. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Waisiraeli na Wafilisti tsawema mna misululo yawo wetowe, aku wang'ali welola. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Daudi tsakapfileka ipfinu pfake kwa imunu ayula iyang'ali yokalitsa imitsigho, kawatsumila awala iwali mna imisululo na kawalamsa ndughu tsake. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Hayang'ali yolonga nawo, Goliati, Mfilisti yana ingupfu, imunu wa Gati kalawila hana imisululo ya Wafilisti, na kalonga ghaghala ghayalongagha ka apfila pfayatendagha. Naye Daudi kamtegheletsa pfinoghile ghendo. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Waisiraeli hawamwonile Goliati, tsawatsuma na kumpfuka ng'ani. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Tsawelongela, “Angu imunu ayula iyalawile mmwona? Kalawa ghendo yawalighe Waisiraeli. Mfalume Sauli katsomwing'a mali nyingi munu wowose ayula iyatsomkoma imunu ayuno. Kuya katsomwing'a imwanaghe yamkwele na iwanu wa ikaye ya aba wake ng'awatsoliha kodi baye mna isi ya Isiraeli.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Daudi kawaghutsa iwanu iwakalile habehi naye, “Apfi imunu iyatsomkoma Mfilisiti ayuno na kuikombola Isiraeli kulawa mna ichinyala achino yatsotendelighwa choni? Angu Mfilisiti ayuno nani, imunu ing'ayengile ngoma baye, iyodaha kuwaligha maasikali wa Imulungu iyali mghima?” <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Wamlongela aghala ghayatsotendelighwa imunu iyatsomkoma Goliati.<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Lekeni Eliabu, mkulu wake Daudi hayahulike Daudi kolonga na iwanu, kamwonela maya Daudi, kalonga, “Heule utsile ahano? Apfi awala wang'olo chidogho umlekele nani akula kunyika? Nomanya apfila pfauli na ichidandali, na apfila ghumoyo ghwako pfaghuli. Ghweghwe kutsa kulola iwanu pfawetowa.”<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Daudi kamghutsa, “Lelo nitendile choni? Apfi sidaha baye kughutsa hata chidogho?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Daudi kamuhundukila imunu yungi kamghutsa pfipfo, na chila hayaghutsile kedikighwa pfipfo.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Iwanu wamwenga iwamuhulike Daudi pfayalongile, tsawaghenda kumlongela Sauli. Naye Sauli kalaghitsa yakemighwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Daudi kamlongela Sauli, “Munu wowose yaleke kumpfuka Mfilisti ayuno. Nene mtumighwa wako nitsoghenda kwitowa naye.”<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Sauli kamlongela Daudi, “Ghweghwe ng'audaha baye ukwitowa na Mfilisti ayuno. Ghweghwe ung'ali kwa msongolo, lekeni imunu ayuno yang'ali yetowagha kwing'ondo kulawa usongolo wake.” <verse eid="1SA 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Lekeni Daudi kamlongela Sauli, “Nene mtumwa wako nidimagha wang'olo wa aba wangu. Isimba au dubu hayakutsa kumghogha ing'olo, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />nene nomuwinga na nomtowa, baho nomkombola ing'olo ayo yaleke kujighwa. Isimba au idubu ayo yang'abama kundagha nene, nene noghogha lumelo lwake na nomtowa mbaka kakufa. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Nene mtumighwa wako niwakoma simba na dubu. Lelo hata Mfilisti ayuno ing'ayengile ngoma baye kakuwa ka wawo, kwaapfila kawaligha iwamale wa ing'ondo wa Imulungu iyali mghima. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />IMNDEWA iyanikombole kulawa mna tsinumba tsa simba na tsinumba tsa dubu, yeye pfipfila katsonikombola kulawa kwa Imfilisti ayuno.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Sauli kamlongela, “Ghenda, na IMNDEWA yawe hamwe naghwe.” <verse eid="1SA 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Sauli kasola ghamaghwanda ghake gha ukwitowela, kampfatsa Daudi, na mwitwi mwake kampfatsa kofiya ya shaba, na kampfatsa likoti lya chuma lya ukwikinga mmambagha. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Daudi tsakeyoha lipanga lya Sauli, kaghetsa ukughenda, lekeni ng'adahile baye kwaapfila ng'atsowele kupfala maghwanda ka agho. Kamlongela Sauli, “Sidaha baye kughenda kwitowa aku nipfala maghwanda aghano, kwaapfila nene sighatsowele baye.” Apfo kaghatsula. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Daudi kasola ng'weku yake, kesaghulila mabwe matano ighanoghile kulawa kuna ichikolongo, kaghaghela mna ghumkoba ghwake ghwa kudimila. Na ghumoko ghwake ghungi ghukinda ng'umbewe, na kamsoghelela Goliati.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi komtowa Goliati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Mfilisti ayula, naye kandusa kumsoghelela habehi Daudi, na ayula iyadutile ingao yake kamlongola. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Mfilisti ayula hayalolile na kumwona Daudi apfila pfayali msongolo, pfayanoghile, na apfila ichihanga chake pfachidegheta baho kambetsa. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Goliati kamghutsa Daudi, “Lelo nene na yumbwa mbaka unitsile na ng'weku?” Mfilisti ayo kamlighita Daudi kwa milungu yake ya chifilisti. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Mfilisti kamlongela Daudi, “Utse kuna nene! Lukuli lwako nitsoweng'a wapfideghe wa kulanga na wanyama wa kubagho waluje!”<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Lekeni Daudi kamlongela Goliati, “Ghweghwe konitsila kwa lipanga, mgoha na limaghe ilitema akuno na akuno. Lekeni nene nokutsila kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA iyali na tsingupfu tsose, Imulungu wa iwamale wa ing'ondo wa Isiraeli, ghweghwe yuwalighile. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Leloli, Imulungu katsokwika mna ghamoko ghangu. Nitsokutowa na nitsokughana litwi lyako, na ng'uli tsa iwanu wa ing'ondo wa Wafilisti nitsoweng'a wapfideghe wa kulanga na wanyama wa kumuhulo watsije. Kuya isi yose itsomanya ka kuna Imulungu mna isi ya Isirael. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Iwanu wose iwetingane ahano leloli watsomanya ka IMNDEWA kodaha kuwakombola iwanu bila panga wala mgoha. Aino ng'ondo ya Imulungu naye katsowaghela mwemwe wose mna ghamoko ghetu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Goliati hayanduse kumsoghelela Daudi. Daudi naye katsumila kwayali Goliati, yaketowe naye. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Daudi kengitsa ghumoko ghwake mna ghumkoba ghwake, kasola libwe, kalika mna ing'umbewe yake, kamtowela Goliati mchihanga mwake, libwe lingila mna litwi lya Goliati na litsama mghati, naye kaghwila ichihanga hasi. <verse eid="1SA 17:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Apfi pfipfo Daudi pfayamtowile Goliati kwa ng'umbewe na libwe, aku ng'akindile panga lyolyose baye mmoko mwake. <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Kuya Daudi katsuma na kema mchanya mwa ilukuli lwa Goliati, kakinda lipanga lya Goliati, kalisomola kulawa mna iyala yake Goliati kwa kumlighana litwi lya Goliati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Wafilisti hawamwonile imunu wawo iyane ngupfu kakomighwa apfo, tsawatsuma. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Nawo iwanu wa Isiraeli na iwanu wa Yuda tsawenuka aku wokemelela, tsawawawinga Wafilisti mbaka Gati mna ghamalango gha Ekironi, hata Wafilisti iwalaghighwe kung'ondo waghwa mna inzila ilawa Shaarimu mbaka Gati na Ekironi. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Waisiraeli hawoyile kulawa ukuwawinga Wafilisti, tsawaboka chila chinu kulawa kuna indalo ya Wafilisti. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Daudi kasola litwi lya Goliati Mfilisti ayula, kalighala kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, lekeni tsisilaha tsa Goliati katsika kuna lihema lyake.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi koghalighwa kwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Sauli hayamwonile Daudi koghenda kwitowa na Mfilisti Goliati ayula, kamghutsa Abineri, mkulu wa iwanu wake wa ing'ondo, “Abineri, angu msongolo ayuno mwana wa nani?” Abineri kamwidika, “Nelaha kuna ghweghwe mfalume yuli mghima, nene simmanyile ghendo baye.” <verse eid="1SA 17:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Mfalume Sauli kamlongela, “Lelo ukaghutse, imsongolo ayuno mwana wa nani?” <verse eid="1SA 17:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Daudi hayoile kulawa kumkoma Goliati, Abineri kamsola kamghala kwa Sauli. Daudi yang'ali tsakakinda litwi lya Goliati mna ghamoko ghake. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Sauili kamghutsa Daudi, “Ghwe msongolo, ghweghwe uli mwana wa nani?” Daudi kedika, “Nene na mwana wa mtumiwa wako Yese, kulawa Betilehemu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Sauli hayamalitse ukulonga na Daudi, Yonasani mwana wa Sauli, baho ghumoyo ghwake na ghumoyo ghwa Daudi ghuwa ghumwe, na Sauli tsakamkunda kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghwose ka pfayekunda yeye imwenyegho. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Kulawa litsuwa alyo, Sauli kakala na Daudi ukaye yake, ng'amlekile baye yoye ukaye kwa aba wake. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Yonasani keka laghano na Daudi kwaapfila tsakamkunda ka pfayekunda mwenyegho. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Yonasani katsula lijoho liyapfalile kamwing'a Daudi hamwe na chikoti chake, na lipanga lyake, iminde yake, mishale na ghumsipi ghwake. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Chochose Sauli chayomtuma Daudi yatende, Daudi katenda pfinoghile. Apfo Sauli kamsaghula yawe mkulu wa iwanu we ng'ondo. Imbuli ayo iwanogheletsa iwanu wose na iwakulu wa Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli komwonela gele Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Iwamale iwolawa kung'ondo hawang'ali wakuya ukaye akuno welongotsa na Daudi iyamkomile Mfilisiti ayula, wapinga kulawa chila mji ghwa Isiraeli walawa waghenda kumbokela mfalume Sauli. Wapinga awo wang'ali wakwimba wila na kubigha kwa ukudeng'elela, wang'ali wotowa pfigoma na pfing'weng'we. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Hawang'ali wobigha, wemba kwa kwidikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 18:7">“Sauli kakoma wanu maelufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 18:7">na Daudi kakoma wanu makumi elufu.”<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Sauli kona maya sideke, kwaapfila pfawang'ali wakwimba kwa ukwidikila, apfo ukwimba ako kumdesa ghendo. Kalonga, “Wamwing'a Daudi wanu makumi elufu, lekeni nene wangaya iwanu elufu. Lelo ng'ambe ufalume yeng'ighwe Daudi.” <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Kulawa litsuwa alyo, Sauli ng'amwonile keli baye Daudi ka munu yanoghile.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Ilupfi yake, muhe yehile iyatumighwe na Imulungu, kamwingila Sauli kwa ngupfu, yang'ali yolonga chaka ka mkalukwale ukaye yake. Daudi yeye yang'ali yotowa iching'weng'we ka pfayetendagha. Naye Sauli tsakakinda mgoha mna ghumoko ghwake, <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />kamwasila Daudi ghumgoha agho mala mbili kwaapfila tsakelongela, “Nitsomhoma Daudi kwa ghumghoha mbaka yananahile mbanda.” Lekeni Daudi tsakahepa mala tsose atso mbili.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Sauli kampfuka Daudi kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakahamwe naye, Lekeni tsakamleka Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Apfo Sauli kamleka yoke kulawa hana yeye kwa kamsaghula yawe mkulu iyolongotsa maasikali elufu imwe. Naye Daudi kawalongotsa pfinoghile mng'ondo. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Chila chinu chayatendile Daudi, katenda pfinoghile kwaapfila Imulungu tsakahamwe naye. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Sauli hayamwonile Daudi kotenda pfinoghile mna chila chinu yang'ali yompfuka. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Lekeni iwanu wose wa Isiraeli na Yuda tsawamkunda Daudi, kwaapfila tsakawalongotsa pfinoghile kung'ondo.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi komkwela neghe Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Sauli kamlongela Daudi, “Ayuno Merabu, mwanangu pinga mkulu, nitsokwing'a umkwele kwa laghitso alino, ka kwitsetowa kwa ngupfu tsako tsose na witowe ng'ondo tsa IMNDEWA.” Kwapfila Sauli tsakelongela mmoyo mwake, “Sitsomwinulila baye ghumoko ghwangu, leka Wafilisti watende apfo.”<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Daudi kamlongela Sauli, “Angu nene nili nani ghendo mbaka nimkwele neghe imfalume? Lukolo lwangu na hata ikaye ya aba wangu ng'awomanyika baye mna Isiraeli.” <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Lekeni ghamatsuwa haghapfikile kwa Sauli ukumlapfa imwanaghe Merabu yakwelighwe na Daudi, Sauli ng'amlapfile baye yakwelighwe na Daudi, ila tsakamlapfa yakwelighwe na Adirieli imunu wa ghumji ghwa Mehola.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Naye Mikali neghe Sauli kamkunda Daudi. Sauli hayahulike apfo kadeng'elela ng'ani. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Sauli tsakelongela, “Leka yamkwele ayuno ili yawe mtegho kuna yeye. Nomanya ghendo Wafilisti watsomkoma.” Apfo Sauli kamlongela Daudi, “Lelo nitsakuwa aba mkwe wako keli.” <verse eid="1SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Kuya Sauli kawalaghitsa iwatumighwa wake, “Mlonge chinyelenyele na Daudi na mumlongele, ‘Mfalume kokukunda ng'ani, hata iwatumighwa wake pfipfila wose wokukunda.’ Apfo utoghole kumkwela imwanaghe.”<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Nawo iwatumighwa awo wa Sauli wamlongela Daudi imbuli ayo hambalimbali naye kawalongela, “Nene na munu yanilihela mali na simanyike baye Apfi mwoghamba mfalume kuwa aba mkwe wangu chinu chibewe?”<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Iwatumighwa awala wamlongela Sauli ka Daudi pfayalongile. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Sauli kawalongela, “Mlongeleni Daudi apfino, ‘Mfalume ng'obama mali ingi ya ukumkwela imwanaghe baye, ila kobama magopfi miya imwe gha Wafilisti, ili yoitse aghala ghehile ghawamtendele iwanu iwomwihila.’ ” Apfi pfipfo Sauli pfayabamile Daudi yakomighwe na Wafilisti. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Awala iwatumighwa hawamlongele Daudi aghala Sauli ghayobama, Daudi tsakadeng'elela ka mfalume katsakuwa aba mkwe wake. Apfo ng'ana litsuwa lya ukukwela lipfike, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Daudi na iwanu wake waghenda, wawakoma Wafilisti miya mbili, kaidumla imigopfi yawo, na kaighala kwa mfalume Sauli. Daudi kaipeta yose hambele hake ili Sauli yamtogholele kuwa aba mkwe wake. Apfo Sauli kamwing'a Daudi imwanaghe Mikali yamkwele.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Lekeni Sauli hayatangile ka IMNDEWA kahamwe na Daudi, na Mikali imwanaghe tsakamkunda ng'ani Daudi, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Sauli tsakaghendelela kumpfuka Daudi, ghamatsuwa ghose Sauli yang'ali yomwihila Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Iwakulu wa ing'ondo wa Wafilisti waghendelela ukwitowa na Waisiraeli, lekeni chila hawetowile Daudi tsakahuma kubita wakulu wangi wa Sauli, apfo taghwa lyake Daudi tsalimanyika ghendo.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kobama kumkoma Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Sauli kamlongela mwanaghe Yonasani na watumighwa wake ka kobama kumkoma Daudi. Lekeni Yonasani, mwanaghe Sauli, tsakamkunda ng'ani Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Kuya Yonasani kamlongela Daudi, “Aba wangu kobama yakukome, apfo walangitse. Ilupfi nemitondo, ughende wikepfise na ukakale kuko. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Nene nitsakutsa na aba wangu na kwima habehi ako kumghunda kwawipfisile. Kuko nitsolonga naye mbuli tsako, na chinu chochose chanitsotanga nitsokulongela.”<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Yonasani kamtunya Daudi kwa aba wake, Sauli, kamlongela, “Uleke kumtendela ghehile imtumighwa wako Daudi kwaapfila yeye ng'akutendele nzambi yoyose baye, ghose ghayakutendele ghakwapfila ghweghwe. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Hayamkomile Goliati Mfilisiti ayula, ng'alangitse baye ughima wake, naye IMNDEWA kawatenda Waisiraeli wahume ng'ani. Naghwe hawonile pfipfila tsakudeng'elela. Heule kwobama kutotsa kwa kumkoma Daudi iyalihela totso?”<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Sauli kamtegheletsa Yonasani, kuya kelighita, “Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mghima, nene sitsomkoma baye Daudi.” <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Apfo Yonasani kamkema Daudi na kamlongela agho ghose. Yonasani kamghala Daudi kwa Sauli, Daudi kamtumikila Sauli ka aho mwanduso. <verse eid="1SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Hambele Wafilisti na Waisiraeli tsawetowa keli. Daudi kaghenda kwitowa na Wafilisti, kawakoma Wafilisti wengi, na wamwenga tsawatsuma. <verse eid="1SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Kuya muhe yehile kulawa kwa IMNDEWA tsakamtsila Sauli hayang'ali mg'anda mwake aku kakinda mgoha mna ghumoko ghwake, naye Daudi yang'ali yotowa ching'weng'we chake. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Sauli tsakabama kumuhoma Daudi kwa mghowa agho, lekeni Daudi tsakaghuhepa ghumgoha aghwo ghwa Sauli na ghughenda kuhoma kuna ubanda. Chilo chicho Daudi tsakatsuma.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Chilo chicho, naye Sauli kawatuma iwanu ukaye kwa Daudi wamlole ka kabaho ili wamkome nemitondo. Lekeni Mikali, pinga wa Daudi kamlongela, “Ichilo achino ka ng'utsuma baye ilupfi nemitondo kutsokomighwa.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Apfo Mikali kamwapfila Daudi kuhulumka kubitila mna lidilisha, naye katsuma, koka. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Mikali kasola chinyagho, kachiwasitsa mlunanda na mna litwi lyake kachipfatsa mighala ya mene, kuya kachighubika gholole. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Sauli hayawatumile iwanu wakamghoghe Daudi, Mikali kawalongela Daudi koghula. <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Kuya Sauli kawatuma woye ako keli, kawalaghitsa, kalonga, “Ngalileni Daudi hata ka kamlunanda lwake nimkome.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Iwanu awala hawengile mng'anda mwa Daudi na kuchilola ichinanda, wona kuna chinyagho na mighala ya mene mwitwi mwake. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Kuya Sauli kamghutsa Mikali, “Heule kongutsukila apfino? Kumlekelela aduwi yangu yatsume?” Naye Mikali kamwidika Sauli, “Kanongela, ‘Undeke mbuke hela nitsokukoma.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Apfo Daudi katsuma, kaghenda Rama kwa Samweli. Kamlongela Samweli ghose ghayamtendele Sauli. Kuya Daudi na Samweli waghenda kukala mna ing'anda ya manabii ikemighwe Nayoti. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Hambele Sauli kahulika ka Daudi yang'ali kuna ing'anda ya manabii ako Rama. <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Apfo Sauli kawatuma iwanu waghende kumghogha Daudi. Lekeni hawonile iwanabii wotabili na Samweli kowalongotsa, Muhe we Imulungu kawatsila awala watumighwa wa Sauli nawo pfipfila wandusa kutabili aku wakwimba. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Sauli hayahulike tsimbuli atsino, kawatuma watumighwa wangi, nawo pfipfila wanza kutabili. Haipfikile lwakadatu Sauli kawatuma watumighwa wangi nawo pfipfila wandusa kutabili. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Kuya yeye mwenyegho kaghenda Rama. Hayapfikile mna chisima chikulu ako Seku kampfika imunu yumwe na kamghutsa, “Samweli na Daudi walikwani?” Imunu ayo kamwidika, “Wa Nayoti kuna ghumji ghwa Rama.” <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Naye Sauli kaghenda Nayoti ako Rama. Hayapfikile ako, muhe wa Imulungu kamtsila, naye kandusa kutabili na kubigha, kudalamka aku kamnzila mbaka hayapfikile Nayoti ako Rama. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Katsula maghwanda ghake na yang'ali yotabili hambele ha Samweli. Tsakakala chidako na kawasa pfipfio chilo na misi. Achino chicho chiwatendile iwanu walonge, “Apfi Sauli naye ka yumwe wa manabii?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Yonasani komwapfila Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Kuya Daudi katsuma kulawa Nayoti ako Rama, kaghenda mbaka kwa Yonasani, kamghutsa, “Angu nitendile choni? Apfi chanitotsile choni ghendo? Nimtendile choni aba wako mbaka kobama yang'ome?”<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yonasani kamwidika, “Mbe! Ng'utsakufa baye. Aba wangu konongela lyolyose lyayobama ukutenda, liwe kulu au dodo. Hata alino ng'odaha baye kunipfisa. Si pfipfo baye ka pfaulonga.”<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Lekeni Daudi kelaha, kalonga, “Aba wako komanya ghendo apfila pfaunikunda, naye ng'obama baye ghweghwe umanye achila chayobama kutenda, kwaapfila kutsakona usungu. Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA, na kuna ghweghwe ka ukufa kwangu kwahabehi ghendo.”<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yonasani kamlongela, “Chochose chaubama nene nitende, nitsokutendela.”<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Daudi kamlongela, “Ilupfi kuna ichihungo cha ukwima ghumwetsi, nene nobamighwa ndiye hamwe na mfalume. Lekeni ndeke nikepfise ako kumghunda mbaka ikacha nemihe. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Aba wako yang'akughutsa nilikwani, mlongele kanidedetsa yaghende ukaye yake Betilehemu, yakalapfe nambiko ya chila mwaka hamwe na iwanu we ikaye yake. <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Aba wako yang'alonga, ‘Pfinogha,’ baho umanye nene mtumighwa wako nihona, lekeni yang'ona maya umanye ghendo yeye tsakabama yandaghe. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Chondechonde nendele ghanoghile, kwaapfila twilaghana hambele ha IMNDEWA nene na ghweghwe twa sale. Lekeni ka nene nitotsa ghweghwe ung'ome ghumwenyegho, heule unighale kwa aba wako yakanikome?”<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonasani kamwidika, “Uleke ukwalangula apfo. Ning'amanyile ghendo ka aba wangu tsakabama yakulaghe, ng'ambe nene ning'akulongele!”<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Kuya Daudi kamghutsa, “Nani yatsonongela ka aba wako katsokwidika kwa ukukembela?”<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Yonasani kamwidika, “Tuke kumghunda!” Apfo wose weli tsawaghenda kumghunda. <verse eid="1SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Yonasani kamlongela Daudi, “IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli yawe mkalangama wetu. Ilupfi au ikacha, chipindi ka achino nitsomghutsa aba wangu, na nitsokulongela ka yana choni na ghweghwe. Yang'alonga mbuli tsako pfinoghile, nene nitsotuma munu yakulongele. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Lekeni ka kobama kukulagha, na ka nene sikulongela baye udahe kutsumila kutali ili uleke kukomighwa, IMNDEWA yandaghe na yang'ome ghendo. IMNDEWA yakale hamwe naghwe ka pfayali hamwe na aba wangu. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Ning'aghendelela kuwa mgima, ulikinde laghano lyetu lyatwikile hambele ha IMNDEWA, nene ndeke ukufa, lekeni ning'afa, <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />ghweghwe ughendelele kuwa mluso kwa iwanu iwali hakaye yangu, hata ahala IMNDEWA hayatsowakoma maadui wose wa Daudi iwali muisi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Kwa uketenda apfo Yonasani kelaghana na iwanu iwali akaye ha Daudi, kalonga, “IMNDEWA yawakome wose iwomwihila Daudi.”<verse eid="1SA 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Naye Yonasani kamlongela Daudi yelahe keli, ka katsoghendelela kumkunda yeye, kwaapfila Yonasani tsakamkunda Daudi ka pfayekunda imwenyegho. <verse eid="1SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Kuya Yonasani kamlongela Daudi, “Ilupfi kuna ichihungo cha ukulawa kwa lwetsi, iwanu watsotanga ghweghwe ng'uli baho baye, kwaapfila chighoda chako chakuwa chahela munu. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Ikacha, haipfika nemihe, ghenda hanu ahala haulongole kwipfisa, wipfise kuchughu kuna lilundo lya ghamabwe. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Nene nitsakwasa mishale midatu mmbalimbali mwa libughulu alyo, ka apfila nolenga chinu. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Kuya nitsomtuma mtumighwa wangu yaghende kubama imishale ayo. Ning'amlongela, ‘Lola, imishale ya ubali wako auno, uisole,’ baho kutsomanya ka ghweghwe kuhona, naghwe kutsolawa hanu hawipfisile, kwaapfila nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mghima ka kutsakuwa mghima, na kuduhu ichikutenda ukomighwe. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Lekeni ning'amlongela, ‘Lola, imishale ya hambele hako,’ baho ulawe uke, kwapfila IMNDEWA kokubama utsume kutali. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Kwilaghana akula kwatwilaghane ghweghwe na nene, IMNDEWA naye kotulolesa tulikinde lilaghano alyo lya ghamatsuwa ghose lyatwikile.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Apfo Daudi tsakepfisa kumghunda. Chihungo cha ukwima ghumwetsi hachipfikile, mfalume Sauli katsa ukuja. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Mfalume Sauli tsakakala mna ichighoda chake ichaghamile ubanda, ka apfila pfayakalagha. Yonasani kakala akuno kelolesa na mfalume, naye Abineri kakala habehi na mfalume. Lekeni ichighoda cha Daudi tsachahela munu. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Litsuwa alyo, Sauli ng'alongile chinu chochose baye, kwaapfila tsakalangula apfino, “Kuna chinu chimlawila Daudi, nacho chimtenda yehe ghendo, na yaleke kutsa kuna ichihungo.” <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Ilupfi yake, tsuwa lya keli lya ichihungo cha ukwima ghumwetsi, ichighoda cha Daudi ching'ali chahela munu keli. Baho Sauli kamghutsa mwanaghe Yonasani, “Heule Daudi mwana wa Yese, digholo wala leloli ng'atsile ukuja baye?”<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonasani kamwidika, “Daudi kanidedetsa ghendo nimleke yaghende Betilehemu. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Tsakanongela, ‘Ndekelele ng'ende kwa ndughu tsangu, kwaapfila wawo wolapfa tambiko ako ukaye, na ndughu yangu kambama ng'ende. Apfo ka konitogholela, ndekelele ng'ende kwa ndughu tsangu.’ Achi chicho ichimtendile yaleke kutsa hana ichijo cha mfalume.”<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Aho Sauli kamwonela maya sideke Yonasani, kamlongela, “Ghweghwe imwana wa ipinga yehile na chiweghe! Angu nene sipfimanyile baye ka ghweghwe na imwana wa Yese mwa chinu chimwe? Ghweghwe kweghela mwenyegho ichinyala, na komghela chinyala wenye wako iyakweleke! <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Apfi ng'upfimanyile baye ka Daudi yang'awa mghima, ghweghwe ng'udaha baye kuwa mfalume wa isi aino? Lelo ghenda na ungalile ahano nimkome.”<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Yonasani kamwidika aba wake, “Heule kobama kumkoma Daudi? Yatendile choni?”<verse eid="1SA 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Sauli baho kamwasila Yonasani ghumgoha yamkome. Kuya Yonasani kamanya ghendo ka aba wake tsakabama kumkoma Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Kuya Yonasani, aku kaghudubuka ghendo tsakoka kulawa hana imetsa, wala ng'ajile baye chochose litsuwa alyo lya keli lya ichihungo cha ukwima ghumwetsi, kwapfila tsakona usungu ng'ani apfila aba wake pfayamghelile chinyala kwa aghala ghanyang'ali yomtendela Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Ilupfi yake nemitondo, Yonasani tsakaghenda akula kumghunda kwitingana na Daudi ka pfawelaghane. Tsakaghenda ako na msongolo yumwe. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Hayapfikile ako kamlongela imsongolo wake ayula, “Tsuma ukaibame iminde yanikwasa.” Msongolo ayula hayang'ali yotsuma, Yonasani kasa imishale kumlumbilila imsongolo ayula. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Imsongolo ayula hayapfikile hanu hailaghalile imishale, Yonasani kamkemelela imsongolo ayula, “Angu imishale ng'aili hambele hako baye? <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Usumke uke, uleke kwima hanu aho.” Imsongolo ayula kasola imishale na koya kwa Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Lekeni imsongolo ayula ng'amanyile ichinu chochose baye. Yonasani na Daudi wawo waliyeka iwamanyile. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Yonasani kamwing'a imsongolo ayula imishale yake na kamlongela, “Ghenda, uighale kuna ghumji.”<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Imsongolo ayula hayokile, Daudi kalawa hanu heyepfisile habehi na lilundo lya ghamabwe. Daudi kenama hambele ha Yonasani mala ndatu mbaka chihanga chake chidonza hasi kwa kumheshimu. Wose weli, Daudi na Yonasani wenonela na welilila. Lekeni Daudi tsakalila ng'ani kubita Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Kuya Yonasani kamlongela Daudi, “Ghenda tseghamba, kwaapfila wose weli tsatwilaha kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA, ka ghweghwe na nene twa sale, IMNDEWA yawe mkalangama wetu, na yawe mkalangama kwa watsukulu wangu na watsukulu wako ghamatsuwa ghose.” Kuya Daudi koka, naye Yonasani koya kuna ghumji.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kotsumila Nobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Daudi kaghenda Nobu, kwa mtambika Ahimeleki. Ahimeleki kaghenda kumbokela Daudi aku koghudema, kamghutsa, “Heule utsile uliyeka? Na ng'wilongotse na munu baye?”<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Daudi kamwidika, “Mfalume yuyo iyanilaghitse nitse ahano, kanongela ndeke kumlongela imunu wowose achila chayanitumile. Twilaghana na iwanu wangu twitingane hanu hangi. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Angu una chinu chachi mmoko chaukuja? Ungaye pfighate pfitano au chochose chauli nacho ahano.”<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Mtambika Ahimeleki kamwidika, “Ahano nahela chighate chatujagha. Ninapfo pfighate ipfienzeluke pfiliyeka. Mwodaha kwing'ighwa pfighate apfo ka ng'amuwasile baye na iwapinga mna matsuwa aghano chidogho.”<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Daudi kamwidika, “Nene wanu wangu ng'atawasile ghendo baye na wapinga mna matsuwa aghano madatu. Iwanu wangu wela, ng'awawasagha baye na wapinga hata hatughendagha kusang'ana chila tsuwa. Apfi ng'awenzeluke ng'ani baye mna isang'ano aino ng'ulu?”<verse eid="1SA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Apfo imtambika kamwing'a Daudi pfighate pfienzeluke kwaapfila tsakuduhu pfighate pfingi ila apfo ipfienzeluke ipfikwikighwa hambele ha IMNDEWA. Mna litsuwa alyo imtambika tsakalapfa pfighate kulawa hambele ha IMNDEWA na keka pfighate pfingi ipfokighwe sambi. <verse eid="1SA 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Mna litsuwa alyo tsahana mtumighwa yumwe wa Sauli iyobamighwa kutendighwa yele hambele ha IMNDEWA. Imtumighwa ayo tsakakemighwa Doegi, Mwedomi, chilongotsi wa iwadimi iwang'ali womdimila wanyama wake Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Daudi kamlongela Ahimeleki, “Apfi ahano kuna panga au mgoha ungaye? Kwaapfila ing'onde iyangayile mfalume inenda mbuke himahima, na nene tsambuka aku sisolile baye lipanga lyangu wala chinu chochose achila.”<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Ahimeleki kamwidika, “Ninalyo lipanga lya Mfilisti Goliati yumkomile mna lwanda lwa Ela, lya kuchughu mwa chitsibao lyohighwa na ichitambala. Ung'abama kulisola, lisole kwaapfila ahano haduhu panga lingi ila lilyo liliyeka.” Daudi kamwidika, “Haduhu ka alino, ungaye lilyo.”<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Kuya Daudi katsuma litsuwa lilila, kaghendelela kumpfuka Sauli, kaghenda kwa mfalume Akishi wa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Watumighwa wamlongela mfalume wawo Akishi, “Angu ayuno si Daudi baye, mfalume wa isi? Apfi ayu si yuyula baye iwanu iwang'ali womwimbila apfino mna tsingoma tsawo, 'Sauli kakoma maelufu na Daudi kakoma wanu makumi elufu?”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Daudi katsika tsimbuli atso mmoyo mwake, na kampfuka ng'ani Akishi mfalume wa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Apfo Daudi ketenda yoneke ka mkalukwale, hawabamile wamghoghe yeye yang'ali yokwalatula imilango, na kaghaleka ghamate ghasulule mna tsindepfu tsake. <verse eid="1SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Akishi kawalongela iwatumighwa wake, “Mwomanya imunu ayuno ka mkalukwale, heule mngalila nene? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Apfi nene nahela iwanu wane lukwale mbaka mwongalila imunu ayuno yanidese hambele hangu? Apfi imunu ayuno katsakwingila mng'anda mwangu?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kowakoma iwatambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Daudi kalawa ako Gati katsumila kuna imango habehi na imango ya Adulamu. Ndughu tsake ne iwanu wa kaye ya aba wake hawahulike mbuli ayo, wose tsawamghendela ako. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Iwanu wose wane usungu, na awala iwodaighwa, na awala iwabunzighwe tsawamghendela Daudi. Iwanu awo wapfika miya nne, naye Daudi kawa chilongotsi wawo.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Kulawa ako, Daudi tsakaghenda mbaka ako Mispa mna isi ya Moabu. Kamlongela mfalume wa Moabu, “Nokulomba, aba wangu na wenye wangu wakale ahano naghwe mbaka nimanye Imulungu yatsonitendela choni” <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Apfo Daudi kamleka aba wake na wenye wake wakale na mfalume wa Moabu. Nawo tsawakala kuna yeye matsuwa ghose Daudi hayang'ali kepfisa mmango.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Kuya nabii Gadi kamlongela Daudi, “Uleke kukala ahano mmango, uke sambi baha, ughende mna isi ya Yuda.” Apfo Daudi kalawa, kaghenda kuna ghumuhulo ghwa Hereti. <verse eid="1SA 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Lelo Sauli tsakahulika ka Daudi na iwanu wake woneka. Sauli aku kakinda ghumgoha, tsakakala hane chimbeho cha ghumbiki ghwa ghumkwaju kune chidunda ako Gibea kuno pfilongotsi wake we ng'ondo wamtsunguluka. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Naye Sauli kawalongela watumighwa wake, “Lelo mwemwe iwanu wa kabila lya Benjamini mnitegheletse, apfi mwoghamba ayu Daudi imwana wa Yese katsomwing'a chila yumwe wenu mighunda ya minzabibu na mighunda ingi? Apfi mwoghamba katsomsaghula chila yumwe wenu yawe chilongotsi mna iwamale elufu we ng'ondo au chilongotsi we wamale miya we ng'ondo? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Ule mwemwe wose mnitendela tsengwe? Kuduhu hata yumwe wenu iyanongele tsa tsuwachi mwanangu hayekile lilaghano na Daudi, mwana wa Yese. Kuduhu imunu hata yumwe mna mwemwe yambonele libatsi na kunongela ka mwanangu kamtsongetsa mtumwa wangu Daudi yanipfisiye, ka apfila pfoyotenda leloli.”<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Baho Doegi, Mwedomu, iyakalile kema na watumighwa wa Sauli kalonga, “Tsanimwona Daudi, mwana wa Yese katsa Nobu kwa mtambika Ahimeleki, imwana wa Ahitubu. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimeleki kamlombela Daudi kwa IMNDEWA, na kamwing'a chijo na lipanga lya ayula Mfilisiti Goliati.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Apfo mfalume Sauli katuma wanu wakamkeme mtambika Ahimeleki imwana wa Ahitubu, hamwe na iwanu wake wose na kaye ya aba wake iwawile watambika ako Nobu. Wose tsawamghendela mfalume Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Sauli kalonga, “Lelo unitegheletse ghwe imwana wa Ahitubu.” Ahimeleki kamwidika, “Ona, nokutagheletsa mkulu wangu.”<verse eid="1SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Sauli kamghutsa, “Heule ghweghwe na Daudi, imwana wa Yese mna tsengwe na nene? Heule tsakumwing'a pfighate na lipanga kuya kumlombela kwa Imulungu? Lelo kaghalambuka konipfisiya yang'ome.”<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Ahimeleki kamwidika mfalume, “Mna iwatumighwa wako wose, nani wakutogholeka kubita Daudi? Yeye kakwela neghe wako, yeye ka mkulu wa iwanu iwokukalitsa, yeye kotegheletsighwa kubita iwanu wose wa ukaye yako. <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Angu nyanza leloli kumlombela yeye kwa Imulungu? Mfalume uleke kundolesa pfihile, nene wala imunu wowose mna ikaye ya aba wangu. Nene mtumwa wako simanyile lyolyose baye, liwe dodo au kulu.”<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Lekeni mfalume Sauli kamlongela, “Ahimeleki, kutsokomighwa ghweghwe na iwanu wa ikaye ya aba wako.” <verse eid="1SA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Kuya Sauli kawalongela iwanu iwang'ali womkalitsa iwemile habehi yake, “Hundukeni na muwakome iwatambika wa IMNDEWA, kwaapfila wawo tsawelaghana na Daudi, na wamanya ka Daudi tsakatsuma wala ng'awanongele baye.” Lekeni iwanu awo ng'awenule baye ghamwoko ghawo wawakome iwatambika wa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1SA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Kuya mfalume Sauli kamlaghitsa Doegi, “Ghweghwe hunduka uwakome iwatambika.” Doegi, Mwedomu kaghenda kuwakoma iwatambika wose. Litsuwa alyo, Doegi tsakawakoma iwatambika samanini na watano iwapfalile pfitsibao pfitselu pfa iwatambika. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Kuya kwa lipanga lyake ilitema kosekose, kawakoma iwanu wose iwakalile Nobu, ghumji ghwa iwatambika, kakoma wamale, wapinga, iwana wadowado na iwoghwawa, na ng'ombe, pfihongwe na wang'olo.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Lekeni Abiatari, imwanaghe mmale Ahimeleki, imwana wa Ahitubu, kasulupuka, katsumila kwa Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Abiatari kamlongela Daudi apfila Sauli pfayawakomile iwatambika wa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Naye Daudi kamlongela Abiatari, “Litsuwa alila hanimwonile Doegi, Mwedomu, tsanimanya ghendo ka yang'amlongele Sauli. Apfo nene niwahonza iwanu wa ikaye ya aba wako wakomighwe. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Kala na nene, uleke kupfuka, kwaapfila imunu iyobama kung'oma nene, ayo pfipfila kobama yakukome ghweghwe. Ung'akala na nene ng'utsokomighwa baye.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kokombola ghumji ghwa Keila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Kuya Daudi kalongelighwa apfino, “Lola, Wafilisti woghutowa ghumji ghwa Keila na wakwiba ingano kulawa mna ipfibwalu pfa ukubetela.” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Apfo Daudi kamghutsa IMNDEWA, “Apfi ng'ende kuwatowa Wafilisti?” IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Ona, ghenda ukawatowe Wafilisti na ughukombole ghumji ghwa Keila.”<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Lekeni iwanu wa Daudi wamlongela, “Lola, ahano Yuda henyegho hatukala twokala kwa ukupfuka, lelo itsakuwatse tung'aghenda Keila na tuketowe na maasikali wa Wafilisti?” <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Daudi kamlomba keli IMNDEWA, naye kamlongela, “Uhulumke ughende Keila, kwaapfila nitsokutenda uwahume Wafilisti.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Apfo Daudi kaghenda kuna ghumji ghwa Keila kelongotsa na iwanu wake, ako ketowa na Wafilisti, kawakoma Wafilisti wengi na kaboka ng'ombe wengi. Apfo Daudi kawakombola iwanu wa Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Abiatari, mwana wa Ahimeleki, kaghala chitsibao cha imtambika ahala hayatsumile kwa Daudi ako Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Sauli hayahulike ka Daudi kapfika Keila, kalonga, “Imulungu kamwika mna ghamoko ghangu kwaapfila kehindila mwenyegho kwa kwingila mna ghumji ghuna ghamalango na makomeo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Apfo Sauli kawakema iwamale wake wa ing'ondo, wahulumke Keila wakampfingile Daudi na iwanu wake.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Daudi hayahulike Sauli kobama yamkome, kamlongela mtambika Abiatari, “Ngalile ahano ichitsibao cha mtambika.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Kuya Daudi kalomba, “Ghwe MNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, nene mtumighwa wako nihulika ghendo ka Sauli kobama kutsa kughuhinya ghumji ghwa Keila kwaapfila nene nitsa ahano. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Apfi iwanu wa keila watsongala kwa Sauli? Apfi Sauli katsohulumka ka apfila nene mtumwa wako pfanihulike? Ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, nokulomba unyidike nene mtumighwa wako.” IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Ona, Sauli katsakutsa.”<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Daudi kamghutsa keli, “Apfi iwanu wa keila watsongala kwa Sauli, nene na iwanu wangu?” IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Ona, watsokughala kwa Sauli.”<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Kuya Daudi na iwanu wake iwapfikile miya sita tsawoka, waghenda kokose kwawadahile kughenda. Sauli hayahulike Daudi ma katsuma kulawa Keila, kaghaleka ghayabamile kughatenda.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kamna isi ya ipfidunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Apfo Daudi tsakakala mna ghamadagho makulu gha kunyika kepfisa, mna ipfidunda pfa innyika ya Zifu. Chila tsuwa Sauli tsakambama, lekeni Imulungu ng'amlekile baye Daudi yaghoghighwe na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Tsuwa limwe Daudi hayang'ali kahabehi na Horeshi kahulika ka Sauli koghenda Zifu yambame yamkome. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Yonasani mwana wa Sauli kaghenda kwa Daudi ako Horeshi, kuko kamghuma ghumoyo yawe na tsingupfu tsa Imulungu. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Yonasani kamlongela, “Uleke kupfuka, aba wangu Sauli ng'atsokughogha baye. Ghweghwe kutsakuwa mfalume wa Isiraeli, na nene nitsakuwa wakeli wako. Hata aba wangu Sauli komanya imbuli aino.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Wose weli tsawoyila kwilaghana hambele ha IMNDEWA. Kuya Daudi tsakakala Horeshi na Yonasani koya ukaye yake.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Sauli hayang'ali ako Gibea, Wazifu waghenda kumlongela, “Daudi kepfisa mna isi yetu mna ghamadagho ako Horeshi, mna ichidunda cha Hakila, ichili kusini mwa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Lelo, ghwe mfalume uhulumke ka pfaukona pfinogha mmoyo mwako, na ng'onde yetu twetwe tutsokughoghela Daudi na kukwing'a ghweghwe mfalume.”<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Sauli kawedika, “Mwemwe mwombonela libatsi ghendo, IMNDEWA yawabaliki. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Ghendeni keli, mmanye hanu heyepfisile, na yuhi iyamwonile hanu aho, kwaapfila nihulika yeye kakengela ng'ani. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Mpelembe chila hanu mmanye hanu hayepfisa, kuya mtse mnongele. Kuya nitsoghenda hamwe namwe na ka yang'ali yokala hanu aho, nene nitsombama mna tsikolo tsose itsili mna isi ya Yuda.”<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Apfo waghenda Zifu, wamlongolela Sauli. Lekeni Daudi na iwanu wake tsawamna inyika ya Maoni, chiwala cha Araba kusini mwa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Sauli na iwanu wake wandusa kumbama Daudi. Lekeni Daudi hayahulike tsimbuli atso, kaghenda kwipfisa mna libambalawe, lili mna inyika ya Maoni na kukala ako. Sauli hayahulike mbuli atso, kamuwinza Daudi ako mna inyika ya Maoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Sauli na iwanu wake wang'ali woghenda ubali umwe wa chidunda, naye Daudi na iwanu wake wang'ali woghenda ubali ungi wa ichidunda chicho. Daudi hayang'ali kosumka ukutsuma yamhepe Sauli, Sauli naye yang'ali yosoghela habehi yamghoghe Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Baho imunu yumwe kamghendela Sauli kamlongela, “Utse sambi, Wafilisti woitowa isi.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Lelo Sauli kaleka kumuwinza Daudi, kaghenda kwitowa na Wafilisti. Apfo hanu aho hakemighwa, Sela Hamahilekoti, mana yake, “Chidunda cha libambalawe lya ukusulupuka.” <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Daudi kalawa hanu aho, kaghenda kwipfisa mna ghamadagho gha inyika ya Engedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi koleka ukumkoma Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Sauli hayoile kulawa mna ukwitowa na Wafilisti, tsakalongelighwa ka Daudi kamna nyika ya Engedi. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Kuya Sauli kawasola maasikali wake elufu ndatu iwadahile ukwitowa ghoya kulawa mna isi yose ya Isiraeli, kaghenda kumbama Daudi na iwanu wake mna mabambalawe gha Dondolo. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Kapfika kuna imango ili habehi na libanda lya iwang'olo ilikalile mmbalimbali mwa inzila, Sauli kabaghuka kengila mna imango amwo yadehe. Daudi na iwanu wake nawo tsawakala mghati ghendo mwa imango ayo. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Iwanu wa Daudi wamlongela, “Litsuwa alila lyakulongele IMNDEWA ka katsakutsa imunu iyokuhila na nene nitsokughoghela na kukwing'a mna ghamoko ghako, naghwe umtendele ka pfaukona ghweghwe pfinogha lelo ipfika.” Baho Daudi kamghendela Sauli chinyelenyele kulawa kuchughu, kadegha libeme lya lighwanda lyake. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Baho ghumoyo ghwa Daudi ghwanza kumtama kwaapfila kadegha chinyele libeme lya lighwanda lya Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Kawalongela iwanu wake, “IMNDEWA yangome ndeke kumtendela chinu ka achino mkulu wangu iyasaghulighwe na kubakighwa mapfuta na IMNDEWA. Ndeke kughugholosa ghumoko ghwangu ghumtowe imunu IMNDEWA iyambakile ghamapfuta.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Kwa ukulonga apfo, Daudi kawaghoma iwanu wake, waleke kumtowa Sauli. Kuya Sauli kalawa mmango koka tsake. <verse eid="1SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Hambele, naye Daudi kenuka, kalawa mmango kamkema Sauli, “Mkulu wangu, mfalume!” Mfalume Sauli hayahunduke kuchughu, Daudi kenamisa mbaka chihanga chake chidonza hasi, kamfughamila. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Kuya Daudi kamghutsa Sauli, “Heule uwategheletsa iwanu iwokulongela ka nene nobama nikukome? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Lelo lola, leloli kwona kwa nenge tsako mwenyegho, haung'ali mmango IMNDEWA tsakakwika mna ghamoko ghangu, iwanu wangi tsawanongela nikukome, lekeni nene nikwonela libatsi. Tsanonga ghendo ka sitsogholosa baye ghumoko ghwangu nimtowe mkulu wangu kwaapfila yeye kasaghulighwa na IMNDEWA kwa kubakighwa mapfuta. <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Aba wangu, lola, libeme lya lighwanda lyako mna ghamoko ghangu, ka nidegha libeme lya lighwanga lekeni sikukomile baye. Lelo kwodaha ukumanya ghendo ka nene si munu yehile baye wala sikutendele totso baye. Nene sikutendele lihile lyolyose baye, lekeni ghweghwe konyembela unikome. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />IMNDEWA yatuhighe ghweghwe na nene. Naye yakuyitsile ghose ghehile ghaubama kunendela, lekeni nene sitsogholosa baye ghumoko ghwangu nikulaghe. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Ukumbuke ing'ungo ila ya ghumwande, ilongagha apfino, ‘Kwa imunu yehile gholawa ghehile.’ Apfo nene sitsogholosa baye ghumoko ghwangu nikulaghe. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Lelo mfalume wa Isiraeli kalawa yamuwinze nani? Angu nani iyomuwinza? Komuwinza yumbwa iyafile au komuwinza ndana? <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Lelo IMNDEWA yawe mlamtsi wetu, yatuhighe nene na ghweghwe. Yeye yalilole alino, yanyamile na yanikombole kulawa mna ghamoko ghako.”<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Daudi hayamalitse ukulonga, Sauli kalonga, “Angu alino litsi lyako mwanangu Daudi?” Baho Sauli katula ndilo. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Kuya kamlongela Daudi, “Ghweghwe kunogha kubita nene, kwaapfila kunendela ghanoghile lekeni nene nikutendela ghehile. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Leloli kunangusa apfila ghweghwe pfaunoghile kuna nene, hata ka IMNDEWA kanyika mna ghamoko ghako, ghweghwe ng'unikomile baye. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Angu munu yang'amghogha imunu iyomwihila, pfihi katsomlekelela pfipfino hela? IMNDEWA yakulihe kwa alila lyaunendele leloli. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Lelo nomanya ghendo ka ghweghwe kutsakuwa mfalume wa Isiraeli, na ufalume wa Isiraeli utsakwima ghoya mna ghamoko ghako. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Lelo wilahe kwa IMNDEWA ka ng'utsowakoma baye iwanu wa lweleko lwangu, na ng'utsolitenda baye taghwa lyangu lihupe mna ilukolo lwa aba wangu.” <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Apfo Daudi kelaha hambele ha Sauli. Kuya Sauli koya ukaye yake, lekeni Daudi na iwanu wake waghenda kwipfisa kuna ghamadagho.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Samweli kafa, nawo Waisiraeli wose wetingana hamwe kumdomboketsela, na wamtsika ukaye yake ako Rama.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1SA 25:1">Daudi na Abigaili</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Kuya Daudi tsakaghenda kuna inyika ya Parani. <verse eid="1SA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Tsahana munu yumwe mna ghumji ghwa Maoni ako Parani, yeye tsakana mali nyingi mna chijiji cha Karmeli. Imunu ayuno, tsakana ng'olo elufu ndatu na mene elufu imwe ako Karimeli, iyang'ali iyowaghanagha imighala. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Imunu ayo tsakakemighwa Nabali na mwehe wake tsakakemighwa Abigaili. Abigaili tsa pinga iyakengele na pinga iyanoghile. Lekeni Nabali tsakeha na kana misi, naye tsakalawila mna ilukolo lwa Kalebu. <verse eid="1SA 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Daudi hayang'ali ako kunyika tsakahulika ka Nabali yang'ali yowaghana imighala wang'olo wake ako Karimeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Apfo Daudi kawatuma wasongolo kumi, kawalongela, “Mghende mkandamsile Nabali ako Karimeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Mtsomlongela Daudi kokulamsa, kolonga, ukale tseghamba, ghweghwe, ikaye yako na pfose pfauli napfo. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Nihulika kowaghana mighala wang'olo wako, iwadimi wako hawakalile hamwe na twetwe, twetwe ng'atuwatendele ghehile baye, na kuduhu chinu chawo ichibighwe ghamatsuwa ghose ghawakalile Karimeli, <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />ung'awaghutsa, watsokulongela. Lelo uwe mluso kwa wasongolo wangu, kwaapfila tutsa mna litsuwa lya chihungo. Nokulomba uweng'e chochose chawinacho awano watumighwa wako na nene nimwanagho Daudi.”<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Iwasongolo awala wa Daudi wapfika wamlongela ka pfawalaghitsighwe na Daudi, kuya wabeta chidogho. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Kuya Nabali kawedika iwatumighwa wa Daudi, “Angu ayuno Daudi nani? Ayuno mwana wa Yese nani? Ghamatsuwa aghano kuna iwatumighwa wengi iwotsuma kulawa kwa iwakulu wawo. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Apfi nisole pfighate pfangu, ghamatsi ghangu na inyama yaniwachinjile iwanu iwowaghana mighala wang'olo wangu na niweng'e iwanu hata kwawolawa sikumanyile baye?”<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Awala wasongolo wa Daudi woya na wamlongela Daudi achila Nabali chayawedike. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Apfo Daudi kawalongela iwanu wake, “Chila munu yohe limaghe lyake mchuno.” Chila munu keyoha limaghe lyake, pfipfila Daudi naye tsakeyoha limaghe lyake. Wanu iwopfika miya nne tsawamuwinza Daudi na iwanu miya mbili tsawakalitsa imitsigho.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Mtumighwa yumwe wa Nabali, kamlongela Abigaili, mwehe wake Nabali, “Daudi tsakawatuma wanu kulawa kunyika watse kumlamsa mkulu wetu, lekeni yeye kawaligha. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Ila iwanu awo tsawatutendela pfinoghile, wala ng'awatulaghile baye, ghamatsuwa ghose hatukalile habehi nawo kunyika tsakuduhu chinu chetu chochose ichaghile. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Wawo tsawawa ka ubanda iutukinga chilo na misi mna ghamatsuwa ghose hatung'ali twodima wang'olo. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Lelo lola imbuli aino na ulamle cha ukutenda. Imbuli aino yodaha ukughala maghayo kwa mkulu wetu na kaye yake yose. Yeye keha na kuduhu iyodaha kulonga naye.”<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigaili katenda himahima, kasola pfighate miya mbili, pfiliba pfili pfa ngotsi pfa dipfai, wang'olo watano iwabanikighwe, makimbo kumi na saba gha madanu, pfikungwi miya ndatu pfa nzabibu itsinyalile, pfighate miya mbili pfa tini, ipfinu apfino pfose kapfidinitsa mchanya mwa pfihongwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Kuya kawalongela iwatumighwa wake awala, “Mlongole! Nene nitsowawinza.” Lekeni ng'amlongele chochose baye mmale wake.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Hayang'ali kohulumka aku kadina chihongwe wake na kasikitsighwa na chidunda ubali umwe, kwa chidukitsa ketingana na Daudi na iwanu wake wohulumka wakutsa akula kuyolawa. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Daudi yang'ali yolonga, “Kumbe ning'ali nibetetsa hela tsimali tsa imunu ayuno kunyika, na kuduhu chinu chochose ichaghile mna tsimali tsake, lekeni yeye kaniliha ghehile kwa aghala ighanoghile ghanimtendele. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Imulungu yang'ome ka ilupfi nemitondo sitsowakoma baye iwamale wake wose.”<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Abigaili hayamwonile Daudi, kahulumka mna ichihongwe wake na kamwinamila Daudi mbaka chihanga chake chidonza hasi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Keghwisa hana maghulu gha Daudi kamlongela, “Mkulu wangu, agho ghehile ghose ghawe ghakwangu nene. Nene mtumighwa wako nokulomba nonge naghwe. Nokulomba unitegheletse nene mtumighwa wako. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Nokulomba uleke kumwalangula Nabali, imunu yehile ka apfila pfalili taghwa lyake, naye ka pfipfo. Yeye kokemighwa Nabali, naye ka imunu mbotsi ghendo. Mkulu wangu, hauwatumile iwatumighwa wako awala, nene mtumighwa wako siwonile baye. <verse eid="1SA 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />Mkulu wangu, IMNDEWA kakughoma uleke kuwakoma kwa ghamoko ghako mwenyegho na kuwoyitsila ghehile, lelo nene nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mghima, na nelaha hambele hako, awala wose iwokubamila ghehile na maaduwi wako wose wawe wabotsi ka Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Mkulu wangu, nokulomba ubokele ipfinu apfino pfanikughalile nene mtumighwa wako, na uweng'e iwatumighwa wako iwokuwinza. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Nokulomba undeghusile aghala ghanitotsile. Yeye MNDEWA katsokutenda uwe mfalume, pfipfila na lweleko lwako, kwaapfila ghweghwe mkulu wangu, kwetowa ng'ondo tsa IMNDEWA. Ghamatsuwa ghose ghaukala mghima, lihile lileke kwoneka kuna ghweghwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Kung'alawila munu iyokuwinza na iyobama yakukome, IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako katsokukinga uwe mghima ka apfila imunu pfayokalitsa chinu chake cha bei ng'ulu. Lekeni ughima wa maaduwi wako utsakwasighwa kutali, ka imunu pfayolyasa libwe kwa ng'umbewe. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />IMNDEWA hayatsokutendele ighanoghile ka pfayakulongele, na kukusaghula kuwa mfalume wa Isiraeli, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />kuya ghweghwe mkulu wangu, ng'utsakwalangula wala ghumoyo ghwako ng'aghutsokutama baye kwa ukuwakoma hela iwanu hautsowoyitsila ghehile ghawakutendele. Lekeni ghwe mkulu wangu, IMNDEWA hayatsokutendela ghanoghile, nokulomba uleke kunisemwa nene mtumighwa wako.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Daudi kamlongela Abigaili, “Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, iyakutumile leloli witingane na nene. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Imulungu iyakwing'ile tsimbutsi itsingomile nene ndeke kughenda kukoma na kuyitsa ghehile kwa ghamoko ghangu yakubaliki. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />IMNDEWA, kangoma ndeke kukulagha. Lekeni nelaha ghendo kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli iyali mghima, ka ng'usumke baye kutsa kwitingana na nene, ilupfi nemitondo kuduhu munu mmale wowose, wala Nabali mwenyegho, yang'akalile mghima.” <verse eid="1SA 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Kuya Daudi kabokela pfinu pfose Abigaili pfayamghalile, kamlongela Abigaili, “Uke ukaye yako na uleke kupfuka. Lola nighahulika aghala ghaulongile, na nitsotenda achila chaubama.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Abigaili hayoyile ukaye, kampfika Nabali kotenda chihungo chikulu ukaye yake, ka chihungo cha wafalume. Nabali tsakasangalala sideke mna ghumoyo ghwake kwaapfila tsakapatika ghendo. Apfo Abigaili ng'amlongele lyolyose mbaka nemitondo. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Nemitondo, imbwali haimkungutsuke Nabali, mwehe wake kamlongela chila chinu ichilawile, baho ghumoyo ghwa Nabali ghwiduka, na kaholola, kawa ka libwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Matsuwa kumi hambele, IMNDEWA kamtowa Nabali, naye kafa.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Daudi hayahulike Nabali kafa, kalonga, “IMNDEWA Imulungu yatunyighwe iyamtendele ghehile Nabali kwa kundigha nene, naye IMNDEWA kangoma ndeke ukutenda ghehile. IMNDEWA kamuhigha Nabali kwa ghehile ghake.” Kuya Daudi katuma wasenga waghende wakamlombe Abigaili yawe mwehe wake. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Wasenga wa Daudi hawapfikile kwa Abigaili ako Karimeli, wamlongela, “Daudi katutuma tutse kukusola ukawe mwehe wake.”<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Abigaili kenuka, kuya kenama mbaka chihanga chake chidonza hasi, kalonga, “Nene na mtumighwa wako, na ahano kuhopfugha maghulu gha iwatumighwa wa iwakulu wangu.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigaili kenuka himahima, kadina chihongwe wake, kelongotsa na iwatumighwa wake watano mapinga, koka na wasenga wa Daudi, naye kawa mwehe wa Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Kuya Daudi kamkwela Ahinoamu kulawa Yezireeli. Apfo wose weli wawa wehe wake. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Ghamatsuwa agho, Sauli kamlapfa mwanaghe Mikali, iyawile mwehe wa Daudi, yakwelighwe na Paliti mwana wa Laishi, iyolawa mna ghumji ghwa Galimu.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">Daudi koleka keli ukumkoma Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Wazifu wamghendela Sauli ako Gibea wamlongela apfino, “Daudi kepfisa mna ichidunda cha Hakila, mashaliki mwa ghumji ghwa Yeshimoni.” <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Baho, Sauli kenuka, kaghenda nyika tsa Zifu kumbama Daudi akuno kelongotsa na masikali elufu ndatu, iwasaghulighwe mna Isiraeli. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Sauli keka indalo yake mmbalimbali mwe nzila, kuna chidunda cha Hakila, ichilolesa na ghumji ghwa Yeshimoni. Lekeni Daudi yang'ali yokala kunyika. Daudi hayamanyile Sauli katsa kunyika kumbama, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />kawatuma wapelembi na kamanya ka Sauli kapfika ghendo. <verse eid="1SA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Daudi kalawa, kaghenda hanu Sauli hayekile ndalo. Tsakona hanu haywasile Sauli na Abineri mwana wa Neri, asikali wa Sauli yeye tsakawasa habehi na Sauli. Sauli tsakawasa haghati ghati mwa indalo aku maasikali wake wamtsunguluka.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Daudi kamghutsa Ahimeleki iyakalile Mhiti, na Abishai ndughu yake Yoabu, mai wawo tsakakemighwa Seruya, “Nani yatsoghenda na nene kuna indalo ya Sauli?” Abishai kamwidika, “Nene nitsoghenda naghwe.”<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Apfo nechilo, Daudi na Abishai wengila kuna indalo ya Sauli, wampfika Sauli kawasa haghatighati ha indalo ayo, na mgoha ghwake kaghuhomeka habehi na litwi lyake. Abineri na maasikali wangi tsawawasa kumtsunguluka Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abishai kamlongela Daudi, “Leloli Imulungu kamwika imunu iyokuhila mna ghamoko ghako. Lelo ndeke nimuhome mala lumwe hela, mbaka ghumgoha ghupfike hasi, nene simhoma mala mbili baye.”<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Lekeni Daudi kamlongela Abishai, “Leka kumkoma, kwaapfila nani iyodaha kugholosa ghumoko ghwake yamtowe imunu IMNDEWA iyamsaghule kwa kumbaka ghamapfuta, kuya yoneke kahela totso?” <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Daudi kalonga, “Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mghima, IMNDEWA yuyo iyatsomkoma Sauli. Katsomkoma ahala litsuwa lyake lya ukufa halipfika, au ahala hayoghenda kwing'ondo ukwitowa katsakukufila kuko. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Lekeni IMNDEWA yangome ndeke kumgholosela ghumoko ghwangu nimtowe imunu iyamsaghule kwa kumbaka ghamapfuta. Lekeni tusole ghumgoha ghwake ighuli habehi na litwi lyake, hamwe na ichibuyu chake cha ghamatsi, kuya tuke.” <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Apfo Daudi kasola ghumgoha aghula na ichibuyu cha ghamatsi, ipfikalile habehi na litwi lya Sauli nawo woka. Lekeni kuduhu munu iyonile wala iyamanyile achila ichilawile, wala kuduhu imunu iyalamke, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kawaghela nongo ndito.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Kuya Daudi kaloka ulwanda alwo, kaghenda kumwambu, kema mchidando kutali na iwanu wa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Naye Daudi kawakemelela iwanu wa Sauli na kamkema Abineri mwana wa Neri kalonga, “Abineri, kwonihulika?” Abineri kamghutsa, “Ghweghwe uli nani yumkema mfalume?”<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Daudi kamwidika, “Angu ghweghwe kwa mmale ghendo au pfihi? Nani iyeghala naghwe mna isi ya Isiraeli? Heule lelo ng'umkalitse baye mkulu wako imfalume? Munu yumwe katsa ako na kengila aho kumkoma mkulu wako mfalume. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Abineri alyino lyautendile ng'alinoghile baye. Nelighita kwa IMNDEWA iyali mghima, ghweghwe na wanu mwobamighwa mfe, kwaapfila ng'amumkalitse baye imkulu wenu iyabakighwe ghamapfuta na Imulungu. Lelo mlole aho hamli. Ghuli kuhi ghumgoha ghwa mfalume na ichibuyu chake cha ghamatsi, ipfikalile habehi na litwi lyake?”<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Sauli tsakalimanya litsi lya Daudi, kamghutsa, “Alyo litsi lya imwanangu Daudi?” Daudi kamwidika, “Ona, alino litsi lyangu, ghwe mkulu wangu, mfalume.”<verse eid="1SA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Kuya kaghendelela kulonga, “Lekeni heule ghweghwe mkulu wangu ughendelela kuniwinza nene mtumighwa wako? Nitendile choni? Nikutotsele choni? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Lelo ghweghwe mfalume, mkulu wangu, nokulomba uhulike mbuli ya mtumwa wako. Ka Imulungu yuyo yakuswangitse utse unikome, Lelo, na yabokele nambiko ilapfighwa, na uleke kuniwinzilitsa. Lekeni ka iwanu iwakuswangitse, IMNDEWA yawalighite iwanu awo, kwaapfila waniwinga kulawa mna isi iyatwing'ile IMNDEWA na walonga, Ghenda ukaitambikile milungu ingi. <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Uleke kundeka nifile mna isi ya iwagheni, kutali ne IMNDEWA. Ule ghweghwe mfalume wa Isiraeli kutsa kunibama nene inili ka ndana? Ule konisaka nene ka apfila imunu iyomsaka ing'wale iyali mpfidunda?”<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Kuya Sauli kamwidika, “Nene nitotsa. Uye mwanangu Daudi. Sitsokulagha baye kwaapfila leloli kuwona ughima wangu chinu chikulu ghendo. Nene nambotsi ghendo na nitotsa ng'ani.”<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Daudi kamwidika, “Ghwe mfalume, ghumgoha ghwako ghwa ahano. Mtume asikali wako yumwe yatse yaghusole. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />IMNDEWA komliha chila munu kwa aghala ighanoghile ghayotenda, na apfila pfayotogholighwa. Leloli Imulungu kakughela mna ghamoko ghangu, lekeni nene sigholose baye ghumoko ghwangu nikukome kwaapfila Imulungu kakusaghula kwa kukubaka ghamapfuta. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Lelo IMNDEWA yawone ugima wangu ka chinu chikulu ghendo ka apfila nene pfaniwonile leloli ugima wako ka chinu chikulu, naye yang'ombole kulawa mna ghamaghayo ghose.”<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Sauli kamlongela Daudi, “Daudi mwanangu, Imulungu yakubaliki, ghweghwe kutsotenda ighali makulu, naghwe kutsohuma ghendo.” Kuya Daudi koka, naye Sauli koya ukaye yake.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kokala kwa Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Daudi kelongela mwenyegho, “Tsuwa limwe, Sauli katsong'oma. Lelo chinu chinoghile cha ukutenda nene nitsumile isi ya Wafilisti. Sauli katsoleka kunibama nene mna isi ya Isiraeli, apfo nitsosulupuka kulawa mna ghamoko ghake.” <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Apfo Daudi na iwanu wake miya sita waghenda kwa Akishi, mwana wa Maoki, mfalume wa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Daudi na iwanu wake wakala na Akishi ako Gati, chila munu kakala na iwanu wa ikaye yake. Daudi tsakana wehe weli, Ahinoamu kulawa Yezireeli na Abigaili chitsuka wake Nabali, iyolawa isi ya Karimeli. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Sauli hayahulike Daudi katsumila Gati ng'ambamile keli baye.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Tsuwa limwe, Daudi kamlongela Akishi, “Ka konitogholela, nokulomba ungaye ghumji ghumwe mna isi yako ghuwe hanu hangu ha ukukala. Nene sibama baye nikale na ghweghwe mna ghumji aghuno ghoyokala mfalume.” <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Litsuwa alyo, Akishi kamwing'a ghumji ghwa Sikilagi. Apfo, kulawa mna litsuwa alyo ghumji ghwa Sikilagi ghuwa ghwa wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Daudi kakala mna isi ya Wafilisiti kwa mwaka ghumwe na miyetsi mine.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Ghamatsuwa agho, Daudi na iwanu wake tsawawatowa Wageshuri, Wagirizi na Waamaleki. Kulawa ghumwande iwanu awo tsawakala mna isi ikwanzila Shuri na kutsighila Misiri. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Chila Daudi hayaghutowile ghumji na isi, ng'amlekile baye munu wowose iyali mghima, yawe mmale au pinga wose kawakoma, kaboka wang'olo wawo, wang'ombe wawo, pfihongwe wawo, ngamiya wawo na maghwanda ghawo, kuya koya, kapfika kwa Akishi. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Chila Akishi hayamghutsile, “Leloli ughendile kuwatowa tsina nani?” Na Daudi yang'ali yomwidikagha kalonga, “Niitowa isi ya kusini ya Yuda,” mala ingi, “Niitowa isi ya kusini iwokala Wayerameeli,” mala ingi, “Niitowa isi ya kusini iwokala Wakeni.” <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Daudi ng'amlekile mgima munu wowose baye, yawe mmale au pinga yaghalighwe Gati, kwaapfila tsakalangula mmoyo mwake, “Hela watsolonga mbuli tsetu ka Daudi katenda apfinoa apfila.” Apfi pfipfo Daudi pfayang'ali yotendagha ghamatsuwa ghose hayakalile mna isi ya Wafilisti. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Apfo Akishi kamtogholela Daudi na kelongela imwenyegho, “Waisiraeli wayaghe womwihila ghendo, apfo katsakuwa mtumighwa wangu ghamatsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho, Wafilisti wawatinganitsa maasikali wao waghende waketowe na Waisiraeli. Akishi kamlongela Daudi, “Umanye ghendo ghweghwe na iwanu wako mwobamighwa mghende na nene ukwitowa.”<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Daudi kamwidika Akishi, “Ona! Kutsakwona ghumwenyegho ichinu chayodaha kutenda mtumighwa wako.” Akishi kamlongela, “Pfinogha, nitsokutenda unibetetseghe nene ghamatsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kolonga na ipinga iyotowa lamli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Lelo Samweli ma tsakafa na Waisiraeli wose wamdomboketsela na kumtsika mna ghumji ghwake ghwa Rama. Sauli tsakawawinga kulawa muisi watowa lamli na iwahawi wose.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Wafilisti wetingana hamwe na weka ndalo yawo ako Shunemu, na Sauli kawatinganitsa hamwe Waisiraeli wose na weka ndalo yawo ako kuna ichidunda cha Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Sauli hayawonile maasikali wa Wafilisti tsakapfuka, kanza kudedema, ghomoyo ghwake ghupfuka ng'ani. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Tsakamlomba IMNDEWA yatende choni, lekeni IMNDEWA ng'amwidike baye, kwa ndoto, wala kwa ghamabwe gha Urimu na thumuni, wala kwa manabii. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Kuya Sauli kawalaghitsa watumighwa wake, “Nibamileni pinga iyodaha kutowa lamli, nimghendele yakanitowele lamli.” Watumighwa wake wamwidika, “Kakuko pinga yumwe mtowa lamli ako Endori.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Apfo Sauli tsaketenda ka munu yungi na kapfala maghwanda ghangi, kaghenda ako na iwanu wake weli. Tsawapfika nechilo kwa ipinga ayo, kamlongela, “Nokubama ulonge na ghumtsimu, na unyinulile ayula yanitsokulongela taghwa lyake.”<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Ipinga ayula kamlongela, “Ghweghwe kwomanya ghendo achila chayatendile mfalume Sauli. Kawawinga watowa lamli na wahawi wose mna isi ya Isiraeli. Heule lelo kwobama unyonze na unikome?”<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Sauli kelaha kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA, kalonga, “Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mghima, ng'utsohighighwa baye kwa ichinu achino.”<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Ipinga ayula kamghutsa, “Kobama nikwinulile nani kulawa ako kutsimu?” Sauli kamwidika, “Unyinulile Samweli.” <verse eid="1SA 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Ipinga ayula hayamwonile Samweli keduka, kalonga, “Wenye ghwee!” Kuya kamlongela Sauli, “Hebali ungutsukile? Ghweghwe kwa Sauli!”<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Mfalume Sauli kamlongela, “Uleke kupfuka! Ukwona choni?” Ipinga ayula kamwidika, “Nakona mtsimu ghogheluka kulawa mdongo.”<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Sauli kamghutsa ipinga ayula lwakeli, “Ghukonekatse?” Ipinga ayula kamwidika, “Nomwona munu kalala kogheluka, naye kapfala lijoho.” Baho Sauli tsakatanga ka imunu ayo Samweli. Sauli kamwinamila mbaka chihanga chake chidonza hasi.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Samweli kamlongela Sauli, “Heule konitsupfa kwa kunighelusa uchanya?” Sauli kamwidika, “Nene noghanzika sideke! Wafilisti wetowa na nene, na Imulungu kandeka. Ng'onyidika keli baye kwa kubitila manabii wala kwa ukulota. Apfo nikukema unongele nende choni.”<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Samweli kalonga, “Heule unighutsa nene akuno IMNDEWA kakuleka, naye kokuhila? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />IMNDEWA kakutendela achila chayakulongele kubitila nene. IMNDEWA kauboka ufalume kulawa mna ghamoko ghako, na kamwing'a Daudi, imunu wa habehi yako yumwihila. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />IMNDEWA kakutendela aghano leloli kwaapfila ghweghwe ng'umtegheletse baye IMNDEWA wala ng'utendile baye achila ichibamighwa ahala IMNDEWA hayakulaghitse ukawakome Waamaleki. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />IMNDEWA katsokughela ghweghwe na Waisiraeli wose mna ghamoko gha Wafilisti. Ilupfi ghweghwe na iwanagho mtsakuwa ahano hamwe na nene. Pfipfila IMNDEWA katsowaghela maasikali wa Isiraeli mna ghamoko gha Wafilisti.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Bahala Sauli kaghwa hasi, kegholosa, akuno kodedema kwa achila chayalongile Samweli. Ng'awile na ngupfu baye, kwaapfila tsang'ajile chinu baye litsuwa lyose, chilo na misi. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Baho ipinga ayula kamsoghelela Sauli na kamwona Sauli koghudema ng'ani, kamlongela, “Nene mtumighwa wako tsa natiyali nife kwa ukutenda aghala ghaunongele nikutendele. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Lelo tanu unitegheletse nene mtumighwa wako, undeke nikwing'e chijo uje, naghwe upate ngupfu tsa ukughendelela na ghumwanza ghwako.”<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Lekeni Sauli kalema, kalonga, “Sikuja baye.” Lekeni iwatumighwa wake na ipinga ayula, wamdedetsa yaje, naye kawatogholela. Apfo kenuka na kakala mnanda. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Ipinga ayula tsakana ng'ombe wake yumwe mdoghodogho iyanenehe ukaye yake, katenda himahima kamchinja, kasola utimbo, kaukanda na kambika chighate ichilihela hamila. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Kamwing'a Sauli na iwanu wake, nawo waja. Kuya wenuka woka chilo chicho.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kolemighwa na Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Wafilisti wawatinganitsa hamwe maasikali wawo ako Afeki, na Waisiraeli tsaweka indalo yawo habehi na imbwibwi ili Yezireeli. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Wakulu watano wa Wafilisti hawang'ali woluta na iwanu wawo iwali mamiya kwa maelfu, Daudi na iwanu wake wang'ali wowawinza kuchughu aku wolongotsighwa na mfalume Akishi. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Iwakulu wa ing'ondo wa Wafilisti waghutsa, “Waeburaniya awano wotenda choni ahano?” Akishi kawedika iwakulu awo wa Wafilisti, “Ayuno Daudi, mtumighwa wa Sauli mfalume wa Isiraeli, yeye kakala na nene kwa miyaka aino yose. Tangiya hayatsumile kuna nene, nene sonile lyolyose baye lihile kuna yeye mbaka leloli aino.”<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Lekeni iwakulu wa ing'ondo wa Wafilisti wamwonela maya ng'ani Akishi wamlongela, “Umuyitse yaghende yakakale hanu haumwing'ile. Yaleke kughenda na twetwe ukwitowa, hela kodaha kughalambuka, yawe munu iyotuhila kwing'ondo. Angu ng'ukona baye ka imunu ayuno katselamlitsa keli na imkulu wake kwa ukuwakoma iwanu wetu? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Apfi ayuno si Daudi yuyula baye iwapinga iwang'ali womwimba mna tsingoma tsawo, ‘Sauli kakoma wanu maelufu, lekeni Daudi kakoma wanu makumi elufu’?”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Apfo Akishi kamkema Daudi kamlongela, “Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mghima, ghweghwe kwa munu iyotogholighwa. Tsapfinogha nene na ghweghwe tuke wose kwing'ondo, kwapfila tangiya hautsumile kuna nene, nene sonile lyolyose baye lihile kuna ghweghwe mbaka leloli aino. Lekeni iwakulu ng'awokutoghola baye. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Lelo uye ukaye, ughende tseghamba, uleke kuwadesa iwakulu wa wafilisti.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Daudi kamwidika, “Lekeni nene nendile choni? Angu wonile choni chihile kuna nene mtumighwa wako tangiya hanitsile kuna ghweghwe mbaka leloli aino? Heule ndeke kughenda ukwitowa na iwanu iwomwihila mkulu wangu, mfalume?”<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Akishi kamwidika, “Nomanya ghweghwe kunogha hambele hangu ka apfila pfayali imalaika wa Imulungu, lekeni iwakulu wa Wafilisti walonga apfino, ‘Ayuno yaleke kughenda na twetwe kung'ondo.’ <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Lelo, ghweghwe na watumighwa wa imkulu wako Sauli iwatsile hamwe naghwe, ilupfi nemitotondo hakutsakwenzeluka, mlamke mke.”<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Apfo ilupfi yake nemitondo, Daudi na iwanu wake woka woya mna isi ya Wafilisti, lekeni Wafilisti waghenda Yezireeli.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kowatowa Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Matsuwa madatu hambele, Daudi na iwanu wake tsawoya mna ghumji ghwa Sikilagi. Waameleki tsawaitowa isi ya kusini ya Yuda na ghumji ghwa Sikilagi, na waghulakatsa ghumji aghwo. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Wawaghogha wapinga na iwanu wose iwang'ali wokala mna ghumji aghwo, wakulu kwa wadodo. Woka nawo iwanu awo iwawaghoghile aku wawagima, kuduhu munu wowose ayula iwamkomile. <verse eid="1SA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Daudi na iwanu wake hawapfikile mna ghumji ghwa Sikilagi, tsawaghupfika ghumji ghwao ghulakatsighwa, na wapinga wawo, iwana wawo wamale na wapinga tsawasolighwa. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Baho Daudi na iwanu wangula chililo mbaka wepfa. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Wehe weli wa Daudi, Ahinoamu kulawa Yezireeli na Abigaili chitsuka wake Nabali, iyolawa Kameli, nawo pfipfila tsawasolighwa.<verse eid="1SA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Naye Daudi tsakaghanzika ng'ani, kwaapfila iwanu wake wang'ali welongela wamtowe na mabwe, chila munu tsakana usungu mmoyo mwake kwa ukuwaghitsa iwana wake. Lekeni Daudi tsakeghela ngupfu kwa kumhuwila IMNDEWA Imulungu wake.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Daudi kamlongela mtambika Abiatari mwana wa Ahimeleki, “Ghala ichitsibao cha imtambika ahano.” Naye Abiatari kamghalila. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Daudi kamlomba IMNDEWA, kamghutsa, “Pfihi niliwinze likingili alino lihile? Angu nitsowaghogha?” IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Liwinze kwaapfila kutsowaghogha na kuwakombola iwanu iwasolighwe.”<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Apfo Daudi koka na iwanu awala miya sita wayakalile nawo, na wose wapfika kuna ichikolongo cha Besori, wamwenga wawo wakala baho. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Lekeni Daudi kaghendelela kuliwinza likingili alyo aku kelongotsa na iwanu wake miya nne, iwanu wake miya mbili tsawasighala baho hana ichikolongo kwaapfila tsawepfa ng'ani, ng'awadahile baye ukuloka ichikolongo acho. <verse eid="1SA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Hawang'ali wamzila tsawamwona munu yumwe Mmisiri mmighunda, nawo wamghala kwa Daudi. Imunu ayo tsang'ana yaje baye wala kunwa chinu chochose kwa matsuwa madatu chilo na misi. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Wamwing'a imunu ayo chijo na ghamatsi. Pfipfila tsawamwing'a chihande cha chighate cha tini na pfikungwi pfili pfa nzabibu tsinyalile. Imunu ayo hayajile, kapata ngupfu. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Daudi kamghutsa, “Mkulu wako nani? Na ulawile kwani?” Yeye kamwidika, “Nene na Mmisiri, mtumwa wa Muamaleki yumwe. Imkulu wangu kandeka kuchughu tangiya jutsi kwaapfila nene tsa namtamu. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Twetwe tuitowa imiji ya Wakereti kusini mwa Yuda, hamwe na isi ya kusini ya ghumji ghwa Kalebu, na ghumji ghwa Sikilagi tsatughulakatsa na ghumoto.”<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Daudi kamghutsa, “Apfi kodaha kungala kwa iwanu awo?” Imsongolo ayula kamwidika, “Ona, nodaha, lekeni tanu wilahe kwa taghwa lya Imulungu ka ng'utsonikoma baye wala ng'utsongala baye kwa imkulu wangu, na nene nitsokughala akula kwawali iwanu awo.” <verse eid="1SA 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Imsongolo ayula kamlongotsa Daudi mbaka akula kwawali iwanu awala. Hawapfikile ako tsawawapfika iwanu awo wapwililika chila hanu. Wang'ali wakuja na kunwa na weka lusona kwaapfila wawo tsawaboka pfinu pfingi kulawa mna isi ya Wafilisti na kulawa mna isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Daudi tsakawatowa kwanzila nemitondo mbaka ilupfi yake nemihe. Kuduhu mmale wowose iyatsumile ila iwasongolo miya nne iwadinile ngamiya wawo iwatsumile. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Daudi tsakoyitsa chila chinu Waamaleki chawabokile, hamwe na wehe wake weli. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Kuduhu munu wowose iyaghile, yawe mdodo au mbala, yawe mwana mmale, au mwana pinga, au chinu chochose achila ichibokighwe, Daudi koyitsa pfinu pfose. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Pfipfila Daudi kawoyitsa wang'olo na wamene na wang'ombe, na iwanu wake iwang'ali wowadima wanyama awo akuno wawalongotsa hambele iwanyama awala wamwenga, walonga, “Atsino mali tsa Daudi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Daudi kawoyila iwanu awala miya mbili iwalekighwa kuna ichikolongo cha Besori kwaapfila tsawatsilika, na ng'awadahile baye kumuwinza. Iwanu awala hawamwonile Daudi na iwanu awala iyali nawo, waghenda kumbokela. Daudi hayapfikile habehi na iwanu awo, kawalamsa. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Lekeni iwanu wehile na iwaghobo mna awala iwaghendile na Daudi, walonga, “Ng'atutsoweng'a baye iwanu awano chinu chochose chatuchikombole, kwaapfila wawo ng'awaghendile baye na twetwe. Wawo wodaha kuwasola wehe wawo na iwana wawo, kuya woke tsawo.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Daudi kawalongela, “Baye ndughu tsangu. Ng'amdaha baye ukutenda apfo kwa achila chayatwing'ile IMNDEWA. IMNDEWA katukinga na katutenda tuwahume iwanu awala iwatsile kututowa. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Angu nani iyatsowahulikitsa kwa achila chamlonga? Ayula iyaghendile kwitowa na ayula iyakalile ahano yabetetse mitsigho yetu, chila imunu katsobokela chichila chayobokela miyaghe.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Kulawa litsuwa alyo mbaka leloli aino, Daudi kalitenda alyo liwe laghitso mna isi ya Isiraeli.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Daudi hayoyile Sikilagi, kawaghalila sale tsake, iwanzehe wa Yuda, ipfinu pfayawabokile, kalonga, “Niwaghalila ipfinu apfino kulawa kuna ipfinu pfaniwabokile maaduwi wa IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Kawaghalila iwanzehe iwali mna ghumji ghwa Beteli, na iwali mna ghumji ghwa Ramoti, ighuli mna isi ya Negebu, na iwali mna ghumji ghwa Yatiri, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />na wanzehe iwali mna ghumji ghwa Aroeri, na iwali mna ghumji ghwa Sifimoti, na iwali mna ghumji ghwa Eshitemoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />na wanzehe iwali mna ghumji ghwa Rakali, na iwali mna imiji ya Wayerameeli, na iwali mna ya Wakeni, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />na iwanzehe iwali mna ghumji ghwa Horima na awala iwali Bori Ashani, na iwali mna ghumji ghwa Ataki, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />na iwanzehe iwali mna ghumji ghwa Heburoni. Daudi pfipfila kawaghalila iwanzehe wa isi tsose tsayangilile yeye na iwanu wake.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Sauli na iwanaghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Lelo Wafilisti tsawetowa na Waisiraeli kuna ichidunda cha Giliboa. Waisiraeli wengi wakomighwa kuko, lekeni Sauli na iwanaghe na Waisiraeli wamwenga wawatsuma Wafilisti. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Wafilisti wawawinzilitsa Sauli na wanaghe, kuya wamkoma Yonasani, Abinadabu na Malikishua, iwanaghe Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Ing'ondo ya Wafilisti na Sauli tsaiwa ng'ulu ghendo, na iwanu iwakwasa imishale kwa minde tsawamwona na wamwasila Sauli imishale yawo, na wamlagha pfihile. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Baho Sauli kamlongela imunu ayula iyamdutile imigoha na imishale yake, “Somola limaghe lyako unihome nife, hela iwanu awano ing'awengile ngoma baye watsonihoma na limaghe na kunibetsa.” Lekeni imunu ayo kalema, kapfuka ghendo. Apfo Sauli kasola lipanga lyake mwenyegho, kalighwila. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Kuya imunu ayula hayonile Sauli kafa, pfipfila naye kaghwila lipanga lyake, naye pfipfila kafa. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Apfi pfipfo Sauli na iwanaghe wadatu na imunu ayula iyamdutile ghumgoha na imishale na iwanu wake wose pfawafile litsuwa lilyo limwe. <verse eid="1SA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Waisiraeli iwakalile mmbalimbali mwa likonde, na awala iwakalile kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani hawonile Waisiraeli watsuma, naye Sauli na iwanaghe wafa, waileka imiji yawo, watsuma. Wafilisti waghenda na kukala mna imiji yawo.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Ilupfi yake, Wafilisti hawaghendile kusola ipfinu pfa iwanu awala iwakomighwe, wona lukuli lwa Sauli na tsing'uli tsa iwanaghe mna chidunda cha Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Wamghana litwi Sauli na wamtsula ipfinu pfake pfa ukwitowela, kuya wawatuma iwanu waghende mna isi yose ya Filisti wakakemelele ukufa kwa Sauli kuna tsing'anda tsa imilungu yawo na kuna iwanu wawo. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Pfinu pfake pfa ing'ondo wapfika kuna ing'anda ya imulungu Ashitaroti, kuya walukondeka ilukuli lwake kuna ubanda wa ghumji ghwa Beti Shani.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Lekeni iwanu wa Yabeshi Gileadi hawahulike Wafilisti chawamtendele Sauli, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />iwanu wose wana tsingupfu tsawoka, waghenda chilo chose, wahulumsa ilukuli lwa Sauli na tsing'uli tsa iwanaghe kulawa kuna ubanda wa Beti Shani, watsa nayo mbaka Yabeshi na watsilakatsa ako. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Hambele, waisola mipate yawo na kuitsika kuhisi kwa mbiki ghwa mkwaju ako Yabeshi, nawo wafunga ukuja kwa matsuwa saba.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>